<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">-Yemsa New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Luqas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luqasni Misirachchuni Kaama</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luqas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luqa.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luqas Tichina</para>
  <para style="mt2">Daamni Yesus Kiristoosni Misirachchuni Kaama</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gachgiru</para>
  <para style="ip">Luqasni misirachchuni kaamaas Yesusnin besifanaas zeemme yoonir yistera raajjuni meyaki kamo makte showo neyaneen sinak abdini meya sine Israelni daraas oodet feena «Mesi» esiisimato dey asuni zala zuutire «Fatunir» sinbaason ammanon besukwa. Luqas; Yesusnin: «Tukamni meyak misirachchuni kaamaason makonak» ababaaskin wostere yeer sinbaasonnawa es misirachchuni kaamaas asuni meya baassosta fa showo showo tesa rakkobesiisik kota epho sinbaasontu makefa. Luqasni misirachchuni kaamaassi arkiron dey Yesusni wolle yoosik makefa koi'ni eddeesikitosinawa hepsa dey Yesusni chowaasik den sama hamaason makefa koi'ni eddeesikitosi mai'sira maktees girani chowaasongwa. Yesusni den sama hamaasneen orfo kiristinnani amantoos aakkak dichnamatonawa taginamatona kotta makefa tochoos wosini meeni matsafaassi han baron tichi barki kamo makte.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha'oosi wosiyani gaamaasik; Yesus koontena wono keemerni meya hamme biyetemato makefa tochoos Yesus garobaase betemeqdesiissi hambaas; kenashto Samirawiisnawa tishire beste naasa tochone Luqasni misirachchuni kaamaassi koi'batu bestefa. Han misirachchuni kaamaassi dilaastan hamma dilaasta kar'a mai'sira biistonak zagtees shiiphoni chowa; Korto Ayyanaasi chowa; mashka meya Yesusnik fa wostobesiisewa Ha'oos boor'aason feeshun ubaasi chownewa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Matsafaas Siruk Ephna Ephobaas</para>
  <para style="ip">Gachgiru 1:1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Haphquni Yohannisnawa Yesusni koontoose <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5—2:52</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Haphquni Yohannisni wostoos <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesusni haphuktoosewa fattantone <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21—4:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesus wostobaason Galiilak jammarobaas <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14—9:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galiilan Yerusalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51—19:27</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Koi'ni torbaniis Yerusalemniissinawa biratobaastana <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 19:22-23:56">19:22—23:56</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daamiisa kitun kabu; ammanon bestobaasewa sama hambaase <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Luqas Tichina Tochoosi Tesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Ulfinto Tewofilosno; inno ganeyaassi sina chowaasikitonon besuni ticha zeemo sinak showoni meya tichisetewa. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Es tichaason dey innok aatiis tesubaastan kabgire aafak biya baassotnawa Ha'oosi kaamanon makset feese baassotnawa; <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Tanu ta teetaasik tesubaastan kabgira gasasira biinanneen orfo tochooson zeeme zoonsobaason oodda neek tichunak ma'ar sinna bestewa. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Es baron zaginaas ne odeta chowaas futo sinbaason arutakwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakkariyasnik Makte Yohannisni Koontoni Tocho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Herodis Yuudaki daasta taato sinna neyaasik Abiyani maagni wosto wostesefe baassossin sina Zakkariyas yiste isa maag feer. Bar dey Aaronni zalaassin sina Eelsabet yiste asuba faar. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Hepobesiise Ha'oosi sina ooko sinne feeseter. Daamiisa kaamanonnawa tumaasonna zuuttambaase asin isa muda foontonon oodet feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Sinuntano Eelsabet zagiya sinna boor'a koonubesi aafa. Hepobesiise dey kur'sete.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Isa wono Zakkariyas basa wostoni taraasik betemeqdesiissi maagni wostooson wostedifer. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Ukkoti maagni meeni tumaasimato Daamiisa betemeqdesiissi girire ixana kiichunak ixa barik kar'i. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Betemeqdesiissi ixanaas kiichchefana kabaasik dara zuuttere gerakalo yerefaat Ha'o shiiphedifer. <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Daamiisa wosiya ixana kiichchefana shoo'aasi hoi'ta teshta yerefaat barik beste. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakkariyas wosiyaason biinaase nayere dige. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Sinuntano wosiyaas: «Zakkariyasno digotaatawa! Shiiphonees odtewa. Asune Eelsabet arqa naanin tanonir. Sunbaason dey ‹Yohannis› yira sunsuta. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Basa koontoos neek akama gira sinanawa. Showo asuni meya dey basa koontoosik girosonewa, <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Bar Daamiisa sina arkirtu sinana. Wayinini usha sinun ooma zaysuni usha isanne aafa ushanawuza. Intobaasi keensi feegedo Korto Ayyanak tuumtona. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Bar Israelni daraasasin showobesiisin Daama Ha'obesiiski wolguna. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Bar raajju Eeliyasnisimato Ha'oosi ayyanaknawa hugnakna Daamiisa sina zeemana. Abani meeni nibaason naanggotbesiiski, ajajamonoy baassotin kayimni meeni techmaassi wolguna. Daraasin daamiisik hoorere feer sinonek zaguna» yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Sinuntano Zakkariyas Ha'oosi wosiyak: «Han bar futo sinbaason awuk aruna? Ta kur'in, asunaas dey woggabaas koi'i» yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Ha'oosi wosiyaas wolgira: «Ta Ha'oosi sina yerefa Gabureliwa. Han misirachchuson neek makonak wostera yaanarwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Sinuntano ne wonbaas kar'fana kabaasik sinni kaamnaason amano beyta boor'a han chowaas sinananneen nibtaatotu sinatawa. Wolla dey aafa chimata wuza» yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Es kabaasik asuni meya Zakkariyas kesananneen oodet feeseter. Betemeqdesiissin tai'ni kesa beybaasik diinqesete. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Zakkariyas betemeqdesiissin kesfena kabaasik asuni meyaneen wollok aane chime. Es bari boor'a betemeqdesiissi isa barik beste wuza faanamato asuni meya arsesete. Bar wollonoy kushubaasik besit feer. Esiisik nibtaato sinne fui'te.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Zakkariyas betemeqdesiissiki basa taraasi wostoni wona ko'ubaase keeba hami. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Garo wonaneen orfo asuba Eelsabet naanertera uuch assa keebaassi aachera di. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Ekka dey yi: «Daamiis han ma'a wuzason taak zagiwa. Asusa ganesi fa kashistonaason tishki.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maaramik Makte Yesusni Koontoni Tocho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Eelsabet naanertenari issunsa assaasik Ha'oosi wosiya sina Gabureli Galiilaki daasta fa Naaziretni katamaassi Ha'ooskin wostera hami. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Wostera hamnaas Dawitni zalaassin sina Yosefnik teegtera di isa durba nawaki. Es durba nawaasi suna dey Maarami. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Ha'oosi wosiya barki yaara: «Ne akamanon suustowe. Naga neek sinfawungwe. Daamiis neneen anetu fewe» [ne mashkasusi ganesin suustowe] yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Maarami Ha'oosi wosiyani wollaasik akamanon nayefaat: «Han bar aakkati nagani ooshshonso?» yit safare. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Ha'oosi wosiya Maaramik: «Ha'oosi sina adda danit sinna boor'a digotaatawe. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Ese ne naanertotarwe, arqa naanin dey tanotar. Sunbaason dey ‹Yesus› yira sunsuta. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Bar dey akamtu sinana. Zuuttambaase asiistan denalo sina Ha'oni Naa yisteretu teegtona. Daama Ha'oos ababa Dawitni zigimooson barik imnir. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Yaqobni zalaasta koi'ba foontonon taattonir. Taatobaasnu koi'ba aafa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Maarami Ha'oosi wosiyak wolgira: «Ta durbawa; han bar aakkak sinak chimnirin?» yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Ha'oosi wosiya wolgira: «Korto Ayyana neyista yoona. Zuuttambaase asiistan denalo sina Ha'oosi hugna dey neyista kerona. Es bari boor'a koontoni Naas korto. Dey Ha'oni naa ustona. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Ne koona sina Eelsabetnu kur'ubaastak arqa naani naanerte. Zagiya yiste bar naanertenaneen haniis issunsa asba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Ha'oosik chimtonoy wuza aafa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Maarami dey: «Ta Daamiisa bozawa. Ese ne maketaasimato sinun» yi. Estan Ha'oosi wosiya kessa hami.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maarami Eelsabetnon Mamsuk Hami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Es kabaasik Maarami taptanon kabira aamaasta fa Yuudani daastaki isa katamaassi hami. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Zakkariyasniki keer girira asuba Eelsabetnon naga ooshshe. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Eelsabet Maaramini nagaason odefana kabaasik katbaassi di nawaas fille. Eelsabet dey Korto Ayyanak tuumte. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Kaambaason dey teggira: «Ne mashkasusi ganesin suustowe. Neekin koontoni bar dey suustowe. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Daamtaasa into taan mamsuk yoobaas awune fa akama ulfinanba! <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Ne nagaasi kaamanon odefana kabaasik katnaassi fa nawaas girak fille. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Daamiis makena baron zagunir sinbaason amane ne awune fa suustonse!» yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maaramini Galatni Shiipho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Maarami dey ekka yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Kaanaas Daamiisin galattonir;<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47-48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47-48"/>Ha'oos kashisto wostinynya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47-48">sina taan biina boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47-48">tuuma nibnaasi safarak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47-48">hetna sina Ha'onaasik girona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47-48">Hawungneen ekalo koontoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47-48">zuuttera taan: ‹Ne suustowe› una.<verse eid="LUK 1:47-48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Hugnaba faana Ha'oos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">taak akama wuza zagina boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">sunbaas dey Korto.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Ha'ooson digefe baassok;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">koontoostan aatta koontoosta kar'a fakuna.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Chima woribaasik hugnabaason besi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">beegantefe baassotin nibbesiisi safaranon gedda sike.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Daason ha'sife arki arki meyanon zigimobesiistan kessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">sinuntano kashistefe baassotin ulfinak den teggi.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Maktanni meyanon ma'a wuzak gawusi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">otumni meyanon kushkush kalla kofki.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54-55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54-55"/>Abrahamniknawa basa zalaasikna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54-55">koi'ba foonto neya besina fakibaason safarok;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54-55">Wostinynyaba sina Israelnin argasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54-55">es baron zaginaas zeemoti abaniisakitonik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54-55">imna abdini kaamaason koi'sukwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:54-55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Maarami dey keez assa sinni wona Eelsabetneen ane diira wolla keeba hami.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Haphqife Yohannisni Koonto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Eelsabet kophona wona kar'in arqa naanin kophe. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Wolkobaasewa koonbaasikitone Daamiis akama fakiya barik zaginamato odesere barneen ane girsete. <verse eid="LUK 1:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Nangirinsinari wono daag naasin haarkoni kunsuk asuni meya yeesete. Ababaasa sunak Zakkariyas yire sunsuk sholset feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Sinuntano intobaas: «Indaane, sunba Yohannis yisteretu suntona» yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Baasso dey: «Ne kooniisasin han sunaasik sunter aafewe» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Estan ababa Zakkariyasnin: «Naanees oo yistere sunustonakinso sholefatari?» yire kushubesiisik besire mamussete.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Bar dey tichuni wuza imonek mamsire: «Sunba Yohanniswa» yire tichi. Zuuttambesiise es barik diinqesete. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Geregere Zakkariyasni terma kotten Ha'ooson galattet wolle. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Es baristan kabi chowa wolkoni meya zuuttesere digesete. Es wollaasi chowa zuuttera kumaasta fa Yuudani daasi biratota wolumtera zi'i. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Es baron ode baasso zuuttere: «Han daag naa hanneen awu sinungeso?» yit baassotna baassotna mamussesete. Es bar sinnaas Ha'oosi argasu Yohannisneen ane faar sinna boor'a.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakkariyas Makena Raaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Es daag naasa aba Zakkariyas Korto Ayyanak tuumtere ekka yit raaji make.<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>«Yaara darabaasin furena boor'anawa argasina boor'ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Daama Israelni Ha'oosik galata sinfawung.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69-70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69-70"/>Es barnu ibe zeemma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69-70">Korto raajjuni meyaki kamo makenaasimato;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69-70">wostinynyaba sina Dawitni zalaassin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69-70">akam fatunirin innok kabgi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69-70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Fu'enaas dey;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">gumayefe baasso kushuussinnawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">oomtesefe baasso kushuussinwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72-73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72-73"/>Es baron zaginaas inno abani meyak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72-73">fakibaason besunaknawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72-73">girina korto teyyaason zagunaknawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72-73">es girina teyyaason dey teyira imnaas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72-73">abani Abrahamnikwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:72-73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>Es abdini kaamaas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">dey gumaniisa kushusin birmadumma kessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">isa diga foontonon barik wostet foonikwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Esiisimato dey neeniison zuuttambaase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">Ha'oosi sina kortoknawa ookokna foonikwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Dey ne han daag naaso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">zuuttambaase asi denalo sina Ha'oosi raajju ustotawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ugnaason hoossutak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">Daamiisa sina zeemma hamata.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Daamiis dey boor'besiison feeshun uuk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">farsone ugnaasi arunon baassok imana.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Ha'oniis fakirnawa kenashterna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">sinbaasik faruni chaarefa denun innok chaaronak zaguna.<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Bar talmaassinawa kituni tiishoossina fe baassok chaarsuna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">Inno taaruuson dey nagani ugnak zoonsunakwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Daag naas dey dichi. Korto Ayyanaasik dey chimi. Israelni daraasik ammano bestona wona kar'ana kabaneen ichma daassi di.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Koonto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Es kabaasik Romanni taate meeni taato Agustos Keesar basa ha'suussi fe asuni meya zuuttere darani faadak tichchosonek ajaji kesi. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Es tesuni darani faada zagtefana kabaasik Kemerewos Soriyani daason ha'sit feer. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Asu isarba isarbaas dey sunbaason tichchonak koontena daasta hamet feer. <verse eid="LUK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yosef koontenaas Dawitni zalaassin sinna boor'a Galiilaki fa Naaziretki katamaassin kabire Yuudani daastaki fa Dawit koontena katama Betelemi hami. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Tichchok hamnaas naanertera fa teegere duusina nawa Maaramineen. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Betelemuk feeseten Maarami kophona wona kar'i. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Uzun naabaasi esta kophe. Irba ha'ifena keyaas asunik oottera ko'ina boor'a maama taksira miya muuba maafana magaassi kunsi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Keemernawa Ha'oni Wosiyaase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Es daasta waali waalin nor'obesiison keemet ha'sefe keemerni meya feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Baassok dey Daamiisa wosiya diinqone beste. Daamiisa ulfinni chaarefa baasso biratoosta chaarsi. Baasso dey akamanon digsete. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Sinuntano Ha'oosi wosiya dey baassok: «Harewa digotiita! Asu zuuttambaase asin akamanon girsuni ma'a odu nittok ephpha yaanwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Hash hawung han Dawitni katamaassi fatir sina Daam Kiristoos nittok koontewa. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Han bar nittok mallato sinana: Daag naa maama takistere miya muuba maafana magaassi kunfeen danati» yi. <verse eid="LUK 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Geregere showo Samaki wosiya es Ha'oosi wosiyaasneen ane bestesera:<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>«Den samak Ha'oosik ulfina sinfawungwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">han daastak dey;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">Ha'o shunfana asuni meya zuuttambesiise asik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">naga sinfawungawa» yit Ha'ooson galattesete.<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Ha'oosi wosiyaasikito oor kessa den sama hamnanneen orfo keemeriisakito baassotna baassotna: «Ese han sina baronnawa Daamiis innok besina wuzaase asinna biyanik Betelem hamniwa» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Baasso dey taptak hamere Maaraminonnawa Yosefninna danete. Daag naas dey miya muuba maafana magaassi kunfeen biyete. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Daag naasin dey biyetenneen orfo Ha'oosi wosiya baassok makena naasa chowanon maksete. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Es keemeriisakito makena baron ode baasso zuuttere diinqesete. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Sinuntano Maarami es chowaason zuutira nibbaassi ephaat safaret faar. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Keemeriisakito chowaas zuuttera Ha'oosi wosiya baassok makenaasimato sinin biyobesiisiknawa odobesiisikna Ha'ooson galattetnawa ulfinsitna wolle hamesete. <verse eid="LUK 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Nangirinsinari wono naas haarko kunana tumaasta zeemma intoba naanertonoyfeen Ha'oosi wosiya sunsina sunaasik «Yesus» yisetere sunte.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Betemeqdesiissi Oottere Hami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Museni tumaasimato kayimni tumaas zagtona wona kar'i. Es bari boor'a Yosefnawa Maaramine daag naasin Daamiisa sina tai'suk Yerusalem ephphe hamete. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Es baron ekka zagsetees Daamiisa tumak: «Uzun sina arqa naa zuuttere Daamiisik imtere korto sinanar» yifa ajaji tichchera faar sinna boor'awa. <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Esiisimato Daamiisa tumaassi: «Hep ameta wedey hep nakaloni nawa maa'a imak sholsu» yifa ajaji faar.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Es kabaasik Simon yiste isa asu Yerusalemuk feer. Bar kaabaason Ha'ok imme fe ooko asu. Israelni faruni abdiison oodet feer. Korto Ayyanaas dey barneen faar. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Bar Daamiisa muudtonin biinoy kitunoynamato Korto Ayyanaas barik ammanon besira faar. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Es wono Korto Ayyanaas Simonni kabgira betemeqdesiissi hamanak zagin hami. Yosefnawa Maaramine tumaas makenaasimato zaguk daag naasin ephphe betemeqdesiissi girseten, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simon dey daag naasin ephphe idimme Ha'ooson galattet ekka yi:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>«Daamiiso! Ese!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">Taak imta Abdini kaamaas ko'iwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">haye wostinynyane sina taan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">nagak den neeki ephwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Ne fatuuson aafnaasik biingwa;<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>Es bar dey dara zuuttambaase asi sina hoossita barwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Bar Aazabni meyak futooson ammanon besuni chaaref sinana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">ne dara sina Israelni meyak ulfinawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Yosefnawa Maaramine makte daag naasa chowak diinqeset feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simon dey baassotin suusnanneen orfo daag naasa intok: «Han daag naas Israelni meyak showobesiisik tishuk, showobesiisik dey faruni ugnatu sinana. Barin showobesiis ephphetoo beyobesiis beso sinana. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Es barik showo asuni nibsi aachera fa safara ammanon kessa bestona. Nibneeson dey suumoni siifoos kalasira aatana» yi.<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Es kabaasik Aaserni zalaassin Fanuelni nawa Haanna yiste isa raajju faar. Bar dey akamanon kur'u. Teegobaasseen ane naafunasir wogga ane diisefeen bar kiti. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Esseen orfo woggaba nangnasire acheechche kar'ananneen wonna wonna betemeqdesiissin tishunoy soomera shiiphet Ha'oosik wostet faar. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Bar dey es kabaasik geregere yaara Ha'ooson galatte. Daag naasa chowanon Yerusalemni furtooson oodet feese baassok zuuttambesiise asik maket faar.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Yosefnawa Maaramine Daamiisa kaamsi makte tumaason koi'issetenneen orfo Galiilaki daasta fa feesefe katama Naaziret wolsete. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Daag naas dey dichetnawa zagitna hami. Techmak dey tuumi. Ha'oosi otma barneen ane faar.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Betemeqdesiissi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Yosefnawa Maaramine wogga woggaasik Ayhudni faasikani heebooson ulfinsuk Yerusalem hamet feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yesus asire heppe woggaba sinfana kabaasik zagtet faanaasimato heebooson ulfinsuk Yerusalem hamete. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Heeboos koi'inanneen orfo Yosefnawa Maaramine keebesi wolsere hamefe kabaasik Yesus Yerusalemuk fu'te. Sinuntano baasso es baro aane arsoto. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Bar ugunni wofiisseen anetu fewa yisefaat isa wonni ugna hamete. Estan arsefe koonbesiiskinawa zomobesiiskina sholok kabsete. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Sholere turuksetenneen orfo wolle Yerusalem hamete. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Keez wonaneen orfo betemeqdesiissi assife baasso ganeyaassi diifaat odefennawa mamsu mamsifeenna danete. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Ode baasso dey zuuttere gasasubaasiknawa wolgifena wolgusikna diinqeset feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Yosefnawa Maaramine dey betemeqdesiissi barin biyeteese diinqesete. Intobaas dey: «Naataaso! Awuni boor'a innoti ekka zagitso? Abaneesneen taneen innotin tiir'o ephaan neen sholet faanirwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yesus wolgire: «Awuniron taan sholefeti? Abataasa keer foonak sholsu sinnamato aane aruwetino?» yi. <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Sinuntano bar makena chowaas baassok aane galowa.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Estan Yesus baassoneen ane wolle Naaziret hami. Baassok dey ma'i yire ajajamet feer. Intobaas dey es chowaason zuutira nibbaassi ephaat faar. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesus dey techmak; yer'aknawa addakna Ha'oosi sinaknawa asusa sinakna dichet feer.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Haphquni Yohannisni Assu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Romanni taatoosa taato Tibariyos taattena asire uuchche woggaasik Pentenawi Pilatos Yuudaki daason ha'sit feer. Herodis dey Galiilaki daason ha'sit feer. Esiisimato dey ayba Filiphoos Ituriyasnonnawa Tikonidosnonna ha'sir. Lisaniyos dey Absanisno ha'sir. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Haannanawa Keyyaffana maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya; es kabaasik Zakkariyasni naa Yohannis ichma daassi feen Ha'oni kaama barki ya. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Es bari boor'a Yohannis Yordanosni akaasi biratota fa daa zuuttambaase asiissi kutifaafe: «Boor'nitiisi fakiyanon danatik harmira haphuktotiwa» yit maket feer. <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Es bar dey sinnaas raajju Isayyas Yohannisni chowaasik ekka yit tichinaasimatowa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Ese han bar ichma daassi ekka yit chaagfe asuni kaamawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‹Daamiisa ugnanon hoossuti!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Ugnaason dey sapsira hoi'issuti!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Doo'aas zuuttera kachchera tuumun!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Aamaasewa kumaase dey zuuttera golon!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Halda ugnaas zeephton!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Kecha kecha ugnaas danaron!<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Asu zuuttere Ha'oosi fatunon biyo!› »<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Haphuktok Yohannisniki ye asuni meyak ekka yit feer: «Nitto ufoni naanggota! Yoonak fa Ha'oosi gi'sin eella kesatik oonso nittok makeri? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Ese harmuntiison besifa wosto wostotitano nibnitiissi: ‹Inno Abrahamni naanggotawa› yit teetefeti baron beyti. Ha'oos han kuni shu'aasikitosin kabgira Abrahamnik naanggota zaguk chimanamato nittok makefawungwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Hash i'ooson tasbaassi kar'a ha'uni anfala hoorera faarwa. Es bari boor'a ma'a gaana gaannoy i'oos zuuttera katera geyaassi ha'tonirwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Daraas dey Yohannisnin: «Eekin awu zagunirinso?» yire mamussesete.<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Yohannis wolgire: «Hep maamba feena bar isaason maamba foontoosik imowa. Muuba feena bar muuba foontoosik bagge imowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Girbo zuutife baasso dey haphuktok barki yeesere: «Assinynyano! Inno dey awu zagunirinso?» yit mamussesete.<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Bar dey: «Makte ajajiistan daysira mamsutiita» yi.<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Meya taar'oni meya dey yeesere: «Inno dey awu zagunirinso?» yire mamussete. Bar dey wolgire: «Asusa waaganon hugnak bo'otiita. Ooninnu sinfaanane eshak malatotiita. Nittok imtefa wostoni waagaas hoorona» yi.<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Es neyaasik asuni meya zuuttere Kiristoosni yooson abdik oodet feeseter. Es bari boor'a Yohannisnin: «Han asu awuzakne Kiristoos sina beyungeso?» yit nibbesiissi safarsete. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yohannis zuuttambesiise asik ekka yi: «Ta nittotin akaktu haphquna. Sinuntano tayistan denalo chaa'mabaasi taar'anonnu kotanak sholsuoonar yoonir. Bar Korto Ayyanaknawa geyaknatu nittotin haphquna. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Bar oodaastaki meyaason sama ha'unak manshi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manshi: oodaastaki meyaason sama ha'uk argasi wuza.</char></note> kushubaassi faar. Kayninanneen orfo kayma meyaason botoossi gaagnir; kadnaason dey tishunoy geyak kiichunir» <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Esiisimato Yohannis showo ugnak daraasin kiitit Ha'oosi ma'a odunon maket feer. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Sinuntano Galiilanon ha'sit fe Herodisnin ayba Filiphosni asu Herodiyadano ephna boor'anawa ooma showo mangsubaasikna barin ke'i. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Herodis es mangsubaasta daysire Yohannisnin taatoni keer gedi.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Haphukto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Daraas zuuttere haphuktere kesnanneen orfo Yesus dey haphukte. Bar Ha'ooson shiiphefeen sama gachche. <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Korto Ayyana nakalone faar sinna basaasta kere. Es kabaasik: «Keeshtefana naataas newa; neektu girefawungwa» yifa kaama saman ya.<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Koontoni Tuza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesus daraasi assuk kabifena kabaasik keezasir woggaba sinana. Daraasik Yesus Yosefni naa sinnamatotu bestefa. Esiis dey Yosef Eelini naa. <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Eeli Matini naa; Mati Lewini naa; Lewi Milkini naa; Milki Yonanni naa; Yona Yosefni naa; <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Yosef Matatiyyuni naa; Matatiyyu Amosni naa; Amos Nahomni naa; Nahom Esilimni naa; Esilim Naageni naa; <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Naage Ma'aatni naa; Ma'aat Matatiyyuni naa; Matatiyyu Semeyni naa; Semey Yosefni naa; Yosef Yodani naa; <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yoda Yonanni naa; Yonan Reesni naa; Rees Zerubabelni naa; Zerubabel Selatiyalni naa; Selatiyal Nerini naa; <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neri Milkini naa; Milki Hadini naa; Hadi Kosamni naa; Kosam Elmodamni naa; Elmodam Erini naa; <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Eri Iyyasuni naa; Iyyasu Eliazarni naa; Eliazar Yuramni naa; Yuram Matatni naa; Matat Lewini naa; <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Lewi Simonni naa; Simon Yuudani naa; Yuuda Yosefni naa; Yosef Yonanni naa; Yonan Eliyakimni naa; <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliyakim Meliyani naa; Meliya Maynanni naa; Maynan Matatni naa. Matat Natani naa. Nata Dawitni naa. <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Dawit Isseyni naa. Issey Iyyobedni naa. Iyyobed Boyezni naa. Boyez Salimonni naa. Salimon Ne'asonni naa. <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Ne'ason Aminadabni naa. Aminadab Aaramni naa. Aaram Aarinini naa. Aarini Eesiromni naa. Eesirom Faresni naa. Faares Yihudani naa. Yihuda Yaqobni naa. <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Yaqob Yisaqni naa. Yisaq Abrahamni naa. Abraham Taarani naa. Taara Nakorni naa. <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nakor Serohini naa. Serohi Rehuni naa. Rehu Felegni naa. Feleg Eberni naa. Eber Shelahini naa. <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Shelahi Kayinni naa. Kayin Afarkisadni naa. Afarkisad Semni naa. Sem Noohni naa. Nooh Lamehini naa. <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lamehi Matusalani naa. Matusala Henokni naa. Henok Yaaredni naa. Yaared Melalielni naa. Melaliel Kayinanni naa. <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kayinan Henosni naa. Henos Seetni naa. Seet Addamni naa. Addam Ha'oni naa yiset feeseter.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Fattanto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesus Korto Ayyanak tuumme Yordanoski akaassin woli. Estan ichma daa hamanak Korto Ayyana barin zoonsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Ichma daassi feen acheechasir wona Daabulos boor'a wostonak mamsi. Es wonaassi isanne aane muwe sinna boor'a koi'baasta makte. <verse eid="LUK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Daabulos dey Yesusnin: «Ese ne Ha'oni naa sinfaatane han shu'aason tusha sinanak ajajowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yesus dey: « ‹Asu tusha tushak aane feefe› yistera tichchera faar» yi.<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Estan dey Daabulos Yesusnin isa tega dimta kisi. Han daasta fa taatoosikitonon zuutire isarga walgire besaat: <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>«Han daasi ha'suusewa ulfinbaase zuutira neek imanawa. Han bar zuuttera taak imte sinna boor'a ta sholena barik imak chimanawa. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Es bari boor'a ne taak sagadefaatane han bar zuuttambaase neer sinanawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesus wolgire: « ‹Daama Ha'oneesik sagado. Bar baron shiipho› yistera tichche» yi.<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Esseen orfo Daabulos Yesusni Yerusalem betemeqdesiisi teetta taamme yeetaat: «Ne Ha'oni naa sinfaatane hantan yeet daasta fillebbo. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>‹Neen oodosonak Ha'o wosibaason ajajona. <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Dey wochonees shu'aasta tuusa'onoynamato kushubesiisik teere neen ephonewa› yistera tichchera faarwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yesus dey: « ‹Daama Ha'oneeson fattanotaata› yistera tichchera faar» yire wolgi. <verse eid="LUK 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Daabulos Yesusnin fattanere koi'sinanneen orfo kar'o danne wolunanneen es kabaasik beyye hami.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnin Naaziretki daraas oomte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Yesus Korto Ayyanani hugnak tuumme wolle Galiila ye. Basa chowaasi wolla es biratoosta fa ke'eessi tuumi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Bar Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasikitosi baassotin assit feer. Zuuttambesiise barin galattesete.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Esseen orfo Yesus dichna daa Naaziret ye. Zeemoti zagit feenaasimato beysani wonaasik Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi hamme Ha'oosi kaamanon feretunak kabi. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Raajju Isayyas tichina matsafanon imtete. Woore ekka yistera tichche dima dani:<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>«Daamiisa Ayyana tayistatu fa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">tukamni meyak ma'a misirachchuni oduuson makonak taassi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">taatere feese meya kottosonek;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">aaftishuni meya biyosoneknawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">rakkoossi feese meyanon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">birmadumma kisunaktu taan muudi.<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Dey Daamiis darabaasin fatuna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">woggaason awajonaktu taan wosi.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Feretaat tichaason birire wostinynyaasik imaat di. Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi diise baasso zuuttere barin kootkire biya ephete. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Bar dey baassok: «Hashti ferettefeen odeti matsafaasi kaama hash hawung ko'iwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Baasso zuuttere basa chawaason ma'arik wolumsete. Wollefena akama keeshu kaamaasik diinqeset: «Han bar Yosefni naastenoso?» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yesus baassok: « ‹Ne hetni asuno; teetneeso fatuwa!› yifa besoson tayista makotimato arifawungwa. Esiisimato dey Kifirnahomuk: ‹Zagit yisten odeni baron zuutira han koonteta daastak dey zaguwa› yisefeti» yi. <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; Raajjuus koontena daastaki asubaas barin aane ulfinsife.<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>«Futooson nittok makonawa; raajju Eeliyasni neyaasik keez wogganewa issun assane iro aane icha sinna boor'a daa zuuttambaase asiista akama maka sini. Es kabaasik Israelni daasta showo dicha asu faaser. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Sinuntano Eeliyas Sidona yistefa daasta fa Sirapta yistefa ke'eessi isa dicha asukitu wostere hamiteno ooma ookinu aane wostere hame. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Esiisimato Raajju Eelsani neyaasik Israelni daasta showo awataatoni mettan feeseter. Sinuntano Soriyaki awataatoni mettan sina Niimantu farirteno baassossin oonu aane faruwe.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi diise baasso zuuttesere es baron odeseteyse akamanon gi'tesete. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Kabserenu Yesusni guchche zatte katamaasi gerakalo kissete. Gawuussi tugire ha'uk sholsefaat baasso katamaas keetena kumaasta ephphe kesete. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Sinuntano bar baasso ganeyaassi kamo aatte hami.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus kiina Ayyana Asusasin Kisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Estan Yesus Galiilaki daasta fa Kifirnahom yiste katamaassi hami. Estak beysani wonaasik daraasin assit feer. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Assifena kabaasik ha'suni hugnaba feena asunimato sinna boor'a diinqeset feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Es Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi kiina ayyana ephna isa asu feer. Bar dey chaaget ekka yi: <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>«Naaziretki Yesusno! Inno neneen ane awuni isarni faarinso? innoti tishkutak yaataroso? Ne oo sintamato ta arifawungwa; Ne Ha'oosi Kortowa!». <verse eid="LUK 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesus kiina ayyanaason: «Isa kaama kotnoy asusasin kes!» yire ke'i. Kiina ayyanaas daraasa sina asusin gansira isanne miir'onoy gafkira kesi. <verse eid="LUK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Asuni meya zuuttambesiise baassotna baassotna: «Han maktefa kaama aro kaamanso? Akama ha'suni hugnaknawa kaambaasi giidokna kiina ayyanaason ke'in barikito dey gafkira kesar» yiset diinqesete. <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Yesus zagina chowaasi wolla es daasi biratota wolumtera zi'i.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Showo Mettannin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yesus Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassin kesse Simonni keer hami. Estak Simonni asusi into gumtanni mero mettera kunir sinna boor'a: «Yesusnin fatuwa» yisere shiiphsete. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Yesus dey barki tesha tai'sere yerefaat meroos baro kofkunak ajajen meroos dey baron gafki; daakun kabira baassotin irbasi.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Awa girifana kabaasik asuni meya showo tesa merok mettere feese mettanni meyanon zuutire Yesusniki ephphe yeesete. Bar dey isa isarbesiisata kushubaasik ta'ire fati. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Kiina ayyanaasikito dey showo asunisin: «Ne Ha'oni naawa!» iyaafa chaagga keset faaser. Bar Muudto sinbaaso kiina ayyanaasikito arser sinna boor'a Yesus: «Isa kaamane kotataata!» yire ke'ire kali. <verse eid="LUK 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Wonfana kabaasik Yesus estan kesse asu foonto fuchcha dimta hami. Asuni meya barin sholere danere: «Innotin beyya hamataatawa» yit shiiphsete. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Sinuntano Yesus baassok wolgire: «Ta wostera yaanaas es barik sinna boor'a Ha'oosi taatoni Misirachchuni kaamanon ooma katamaassi fe asuni meyak hamma makonak sholsuwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Es bari boor'a Yuudani daasta fa Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasikitosi girifaafe kaambaason maket feer.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Nawobaasakitoni Teege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Isa wona Yesus Gensaretki Baarisi ha'a feen showo asuni meya ek barki tai'sere Ha'oosi kaamanon odok tugset feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Bar es Baarisi ha'a yere hep goonu bi. Kurxummi eshefe baasso goonuussin kerere yugudobesiison mei'sedifer. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesus Simoonnir sina goonuussi giri. Simoonnin: «Han goonuuson daastan ek akaasta garonon taak chiksuwa» yi. Estan goonuusta diifaat esta fe daraasin assi. <figure style="fig" alt="Fisher men in their fishing boat" file="HK00208B.tif" size="span" ref="5:2">Goonubesiissi diisefaat qurxummiison eshefe asuni meya </figure><verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Wolumbaaso koi'sinanneen orfo Simoonnin: «Goonuuson tir'maasta eksaat neneen zomoneesakitoneen Kurxummiison eshak yugudontiison tir'maassi ha'utiwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simon wolgire: «Assinynyano! Waalaason zuutira kabet ha'ira isanne aane daneniwa. Sinuntano hash ne maketanneen kurxummiison eshak yugudooson akaassi ha'unawa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Es baron zagsobesiise yugudoos karatonanneen akama showo kurxummi hophete. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Estan ooma goonuusta fe zomobesiisakito yeesere argassonek giphsok teegsete. Baasso dey yeesere hep goonuuson akaas koor'ananneen kurxummik tuunisete. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8-9"/>Barnawa basa zomosakitona zuuttere ephete kurxummiisi aatamak akamanon diinqesete. Simon Phexiros dey sina chowaason biyaat Yesusni sina kaa'nere: «Daamiiso! Ta boor' sinna boor'a tayistan eksowa!» yi. <verse eid="LUK 5:8-9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Esiisimato Simonni zomo sina Zebdewosni naanggotiis Yaqobnawa Yohannisna diinqesete. Yesus Simoonnin: «Harewa digotaata! Hawungneen ekalo asuni meyanon Ha'ooski zuutunir sinatawa.»<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Baasso dey goonubesiison akaassin kisire daasta kunsaat zuuttambaase asin beyye Yesusni nawo sinete.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Awataatoni Mettaniisin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Isawa Yesus isa katamasi feen atubaason awataatoni mero koi'sina asu barin biire sinba kaa'nefaat: «Daamiiso! Sholefaatane taan kayimsuk chimatawa» yit shiiphe. <verse eid="LUK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesus kushubaason shongere atubaason taptifaat: «Sholefawungwa! Faruwa!» yi. Geregere merobaassin fari. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Tusire dey Yesus: «Han sina chowaason ooniknu makotaatawa. Sinuntano hamfaat kayimneeson maagnik besuwa. Asusik zaala sinanak kayimneeson besifa Muse ajajena maa'aason imma» yire ajaje.<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Yesus zagina chowaasi wolla zeemotiistan tagi. Showo asuni meya barkin odoknawa merobesiissin farusonekna sholsefaat zuutteset feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Sinuntano Yesus bar bar showo wona shaato dimsi hamfaafe shiiphet feer.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Laafa Asunin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Isa wona Yesus asuni meyanon assifeen Ferisawini meenewa Museni tumaasi assinynyani meena basa tesha diisefer. Es baasso Galiilannawa Yuudaki ke'e zuuttambaase asiissina dey Yerusalemunna yeeseter. Yesus mettaniisin fatuna Ha'oosi hugna barneen ane faar. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Asuni meya isa laafa asunin kuphota wor'ere Yesusniki yeesete. Laafaasin Yesus feena keyaassi gedde basa sina kunsuk sholsete. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Sinuntano asusa showotan kabi chowa laafa asusi keer gedak aane chimoto. Es bari boor'a keyaasi tukta kesfaat yiiroson bogge laafaasi kuphobaase keer gedde asusa ganesi Yesusni sina kunussete. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesus baasso amantooson biyaat laafaasin: «Ne han asuso! Boor'nees feeshun yistewa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa Ferisawini meena: «Ha'oosta mei'ni kaama makefees han bar oonso? Boor'aason feeshun uuk chimniis Ha'o bar bartano oom oonso?» yit nibbesiissi safarsete.<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yesus dey nibbesiisi safaranon arifaat: «Nibnitiissi awuniron ekka safarefetiso? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>‹Boor'nees feeshun› yistewa uustannawa: ‹Kabira hamma› uustanna aaffarinso kashoyi? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Sinuntano Asuni Naa han daasta boor'aason feeshun una ha'suni hugnaba faanamato arutik sholsifawa» iyaat laafaasin: «Ne han asuso kabira kuphoneeson wor'a keene hamma!» yi.<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Geregere laafaas asusa sina kabire kunna kuphooson wor'e Ha'o galattet keeba hami. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Es baron biya asuni meya akamanon diinqoknawa digakna: «Hawung diinqi wuza biini» yiset Ha'ooson galattesete.<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lewi Yesusni Nawo Sinanak Teegte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Yesus estan kesse hamfena kabaasik Lewi yiste girbo zuuti asu girbo zuuttefana keyaassi diifaat waaga zuutifeen biire: «Taneen ane hamniwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Lewi fa wuzason zuutire beyfaat kabire Yesusneen ane hami.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Estan Lewi keebaassi Yesusnik akama koota hoossi. Es kootaasta showo girbo zuutife baassonawa oom irbana teegtere feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Ferisawini meenewa baasso keen sina Museni tumaasi assinynyana Yesusni nawoosakitonita: «Nitto awagan girbo zuutife asuni meyaneennawa boor'inynyani meyaneenna isarik maara ushtifetirinso?» yit unyisete. <verse eid="LUK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Mettanni meyaktano fayyanik hetni asu aane sholsifewa. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Ta yaanay boor'ni meyanon Ha'ooski wolguktano kayimni meyanon teegok aane yootwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Soomere Shiiphoosik Mamuste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Baasso dey: «Haphqife Yohannisni nawoosnawa Ferisawini meeni nawoosakitona showo wona soomere Ha'o shiiphseter. Sinuntano ne nawoosakito awuni boor'anso meere ushefeysi?» yire mamussete.<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesus wolgire: «Mariis ane feen mozgituusakito soomere shiiphosonanne faar sinna bestefawoso? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Sinuntano mari baassostan oor kesana wona yoona. Es kabaasik soomere shiiphosonewa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Tusire dey Yesus isa beso baassok make: «Gaddo mayaastan erbe kar'e kur'u mayta kunsire zoorifer aafe. Zagtefaanane gaddooson karasir. Gaddo erbees dey kur'usneen isar aafa sinanawuza. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Esiisimato dey kur'u ha'matosi gaddo wayinini usha gedfe asu oonu aafewa. Gedfaanane gaddo wayinini ushaas ha'matooson karasir; bar dey wuukter; ha'matoos dey ke'nor sinar. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Ora wayinini ushaason gaddo ha'matosi geda sholsifa. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Showo wona kaagga di wayinini ushaason usha asu gaddooson ushanak aane sholefe. ‹Kaaga wayinini ushaastu ma'arwa› utu una» yi.<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Beysani Wonni Mamsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Beysani wonak Yesus foshaasta kamo aatte hamfeen basa nawoosakito zagoni bona buggire mo'e koyete. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Ferisawini meyaassin isa isaas: «Beysani wonak zagtonak sholsunoy wuzason awuniron zagidifetirinso?» yire mamussete. <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesus wolgire: «Dawitnawa barneen ane fe asuni meena maktesefe kabaasik bar zagina baron aane feretira biyetinoso? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Ha'oosi keer girire maagni meyaktano oom asu muunoyna Ha'ok imto tushaason ephphe me. Barneen feese baassok dey imi» yi. <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Estan Yesus: «Asuni Naa beysani wonaasi daamwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kushu Laafaasin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Ooma beysani wonak dey Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi girire assit feer. Esta hoi'ta kushuba laafa sina isa asu feer. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa Ferisawini meena Yesusni malassone ugnani danak sholsefaat: «Beysani wonaasik asunin fatunitto biyaniwa» yit oodet feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Sinuntano Yesus baasso nibaasi safaranon arifaat kushuba laafa asusin: «Kabira ganeyaassi yerowa» yi. Bar dey kabire ganeyaassi yere. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Estan baassotin: «Ta nittotin mamsunawa; Beysani wonaasik ma'aron zagungwa wedey mangunon zagunso? Kaani fatungwa wedey tishkunso?» yi. <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Biratobaasta fe asusi zuutire biinanneen orfo laafa asusin: «Kushuneeson zeephwa» yi. Bar dey zeephin Kushubaas dey fari. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa Ferisawini meena akamanon gi'tesere Yesusniista awu zagsonemato baassotna baassotna merkesete.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asire Heppe Wosini Meyanon Kori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Es wonaassi Yesus shiiphonak den aamaasta kesi. Es Waalaason zuutire Ha'ooski shiiphet ha'i. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Wonfana kabaasik nawobaasakitonin barki teege. Baassossin asire heppeesin korire: «Wosi» yire teege. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Baasso dey Phexiros yire teegena Simonnawa ayba Indiriyas, Yaqob, Yohannis, Filiphoos, Bertelemewos, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Maatiwos, Tomas, Ilfiyosni naa Yaqob, kooner yistefe Simon, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yaqobni naa Yihudanawa orfo Yesusni aatire ima Askorotki Yuudanawa.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Showo asunin Fatubaasewa Assubaase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesus wosibaasakitoneen aamaastan kerere golo daasta yere. Nawoni meyaassin showobesiis dey esta feeseter. Esiisimato showo asuni meya barkin odosoneknawa merobesiissin farsonekna Yuudani daasta fa Yerusalemni katama; baarisi ha'taki fa katama Tirosunnawa Sidonanna ye showo dara feer. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Kiina ayyanak oottere mettet feese baasso dey farsete. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Ha'oosi fatuni hugna Yesusniissin kesfaafa zuuttambesiise fatit faar sinna boor'a esta zuuttere feese asuni meya barin ta'isere farsonek sholset feeseter.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Giranewa Suumoni Besone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Yesus nawobaasakitoniki yerqere biyet ekka yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Ha'oosi taatoni ha'su;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">nittor sinna boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">nitto tukamiis suustowa.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Hash maktet fe nitto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">gawutir sinna boor'a suustowa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Hash waassefe nitto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">woli mi'atir sinna boor'a suustowa.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>«Asuni Naa sina ta boor'a asuni meya nittotin oomtesere, korire, kashshiserenawa nittok mangu suna imefe kabaasikna nitto suustowa. <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Samak waagnitiis akama sinna boor'a han bar zuuttambaase nittoosta kar'fana kabaasik giroti dey filloti. Zeemoti ababesiisakito dey raajjuni meyaasta ekkatu zagsete.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>«Sinuntano nitto otumno!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">Han daastaki foontiisik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">sholsu wuzason daneti boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">habuntiwa;<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Hash gawi nitto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">woli maktotir sinna boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">habuntiwayerefawutiwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">hash mi'fe nitto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">woli suumera waasutir sinna boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">yerefawutiwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>«Asuni meya zuuttere mai'nitiison maksefe nitto habuntiwa. Baasso abaasnu eshni raajjuni meyak ekkatu zagsetewa.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gumaasin Shuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>«Sinuntano odefe nittok ekka yifawungwa, gumantiisin shunti. Nittotin oomtefe baassok ma'aron zaguti. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Nittotin erwife baassotin eebbisuti. Nittotin miir'efe baassok dey shiiphoti. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Isa gachneeson bocha barik hepsaason dey bochanak besu. Kootineeson ephfe barik shaamisineeson daysira imma. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Neekin shiiphefe baassok imma. Waagneeson epha barin neek wolgunak mamsutaata. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Asuni meya nittok zagsonek sholefeti baron nitto dey esiisimato baassok zagutiwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>Nittotin shunfe baassotin shunfaatine aro gaddo wuza danatirinso? Boor'ni meyanu baassotin shunefe baassotintu shunefe. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Ma'aron nittok zagi baassok ma'aron zagifaatine aro gaddo wuza danatirinso? Boor'ni meyanu esiisontu zagsefewa. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>‹Kowa kaassonewa› iyaat baassok liqsaatine aro gaddo wuza danatirinso? Boor'ni meyanu es liqsisete baron wolgire ephaasik boor'ni meya boor'ni meyaktu liqessisefewa. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Sinuntano nitto gumantiisi shunti. Baassok dey ma'aron zaguti. ‹Wolgira ephaniwa› yira abdi zagunoy liqessuti. Es baron zagaatine waagnitiis akama sinana. Dey zuuttambaase asi denalo sina Ha'oosi naanggota sinati. Ha'oos baron galattonoy baassokneennawa manguni meyakneenna garamawa. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Samaki Abantiis kenashter sinna boor'a nitto dey kenashter sintiwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oomiisata Mangsu Kar'atiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>«Ooniistanu mangsu kar'atiita; nittoosta dey aafa mangsu katona wuza. Nitto asuniista nalga wostotiita; nittoosta nalga aafa sinanawuza. Feeshun uti nittok dey feeshun ustona. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Imtiwa; nittok dey imtona. Safarera imti safareesik wolla nittok safartera imtona. Ma'a safarek tuumma tichera tiir'era woottonanneen safartera nittok imtonawa.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Dey han besoson ekka yit make: «Aaftishu aaftishuni zoonsuk chimniroso? Zoonsifaanane hepobaase ane zatere gawuussitu gandosonawa. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Arinynyaas assinynyaasatan denalo aafa sinanawuza. Sinuntano mai'sire ari arinynyaas assinynyaasne feer sinana. <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Ne aafaassi yere inya i'ooson biinoy ayneesa aafsi kuni diimaason aakkak biitso? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Ne aafaassi yere i'ooson biinoy aakkak ayneesin: ‹Aytaaso aafneessi kuni diimaason kisunaroso?› uuk chimisso? Sinnoy sinne bestefe ne zeemma aafneessi kuni i'ooson kisuwa. Estan ayneesa aafsi kuni diimaason gasasira biyak chimatawa.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">I'oosewa Gaanbaase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>«Ma'a i'oos mangu gaana aane gaanfa. Esiisimato dey mangu i'o ma'a gaana aane gaanfa. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>I'o zuuttambaase gaambaasiktu artefa. Seer'akin belesini gaana aane kephtefa. Alaluussin wayinini gaana aane kephtefa. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Ma'a asu nibbaassi fa ma'a chowaasontu kisife. Mangu asu nibbaassi tuuma mangu chowaasontu kisife. Asu nibbaassi tuumma fu'te barontu noonobaasik wollefe.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daagnawa Aruna Asi Keeni Keer'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>«Ta makena baron zagunoy awuniron: ‹Daamiiso! Daamiiso!› yit taan teegefetiso? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Taaki yooni barnawa kaamnaason odere wostota feeshife barna oone feer sinnamato makonawa. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Bar doo'aason akamanon yiishshe kaa'oosta keebaason keer'a asune feerwa. Omara yaara es keyaason tugin es keyaas yiishtera keetena boor'a shorkunak aane chima. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Kaamnaason odere wostota feeshunoy bar keebaason mai'sire yiihnoy fuutuusta keer'a asune feerwa. Omaraas yaara keyaason tugifana kabaasik geregere gande. Gandobaasnu akamanon mangu sini» yi.<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Tii Meya Taar'oosa Ha'sinynyani Amano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yesus es baron zuuttambaase daraasik makere koi'sinanneen orfo Kifirnahom yistefa katamaassi hami. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Estak isa Romanni tii meya taar'oni meeni gaanynya feer. Bar dey isa shunfena wostinynyaba akamanon mettere kituk tai'sere feer. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Es tii meya taar'oni meeni gaanynyaas Yesusni chowaason odenayse Ayhudni kur'uni meyanon: «Yesus yeere wostinynyataasin fatunak hamma taak shiiphotiwa» yire barki wosi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4-5"/>Baasso Yesusniki hamere: «Han asu daraniisi shunar; Ayhudni shiiphoni keya dey keer'i; es bari boor'a han baron barik zagutak sholsuwa» yit chinire shiiphsete.<verse eid="LUK 7:4-5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Es bari boor'a Yesus baassoneen ane hami. Keebaaski tai'sefena kabaasik tii meya taar'oni gaanynyaas zomobaasakitonin Yesusniki ekka yit wosi: «Daamiiso; ne taaki keer girutak ta sholsu asutewa; kutira hoputaata. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Ta teetnaasiknu neeki yoonak sholsu asutewa. Es bari boor'a ek faataasta faagedo kaama makowa; wostinynyataas dey farunawa. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Ta teetnaasik oom ha'sinynyani meeni sikalosi ha'i asuwa. Ta sikaloossi dey ta ajajefana meya taar'oni meya feeseterwa. Isaasin: ‹Ek hamma› iyaanane hamar; Oomiisin: ‹Hani yowa!› iyaanane yeer; wostinynyataasin: ‹Han baron zaguwa› iyaanane zagir» <verse eid="LUK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesus es baron odere diinqe. Yerqere orfobaase yeesefe asuni meyak: «Israelni daraasasinnu effatena amanto aane danutwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Wostere Yesusniki hama asuni meya tii meya taar'oosa gaanynyani keer wolle yeeseten wostinynyaas farire feen danete.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Dicha Asusi Naanin Kitun Kabgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Wonotirik Yesus Nayin yistefa isa katama hami. Basa nawoosnawa showo darana barneen ane hamete. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Yesus es katamaasi finynyita kar'fena kabaasik asuni meya dugno wor'ere katamaassin kesedifer. Es kiti bar dey intobaasik isa bar bar. Intobaas dey dicha asu. Showo es katamaasi dara dey ane feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Daamiis baron biire kenashtefaat: «Harewe waasutaatawe!» yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Estan Yesus ek sina taarifaat saa'ooson ta'i. Wor'a baasso dey yersete. Yesus dey: «Han na'o naaso kabuwa yifawungwa!» yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Kitu naas dey kabire wollo ephi. Estan Yesus naasa intok: «Naane hanifewe» yit imi.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Asuni meya zuuttambesiise akamanon digsere: «Akam raajju inno ganeyaassin kabiwa. Ha'oos dey bari daraasi argasuk yawa» yit Ha'ooson galattesete. <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Yesus zagina chowaasi wolla Yuudani daastanawa biratobaastaki fa daa zuuttambaase asiissi odte.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Haphquni Yohannisna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Haphqife Yohannisni nawoosakito Yesus zagina chowaason zuutire Yohannisnik maksete. Nawobaasasin heppin teegere: <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>«Es yoonir yiste Kiristoos nengwa wedey oomnin oodanirinso? yira mamsutiwa» yit Yesusniki wosi.<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Baasso dey Yesusniki hamere: « ‹Es yoonir yiste Kiristoos nengwa wedey oomnin oodanirinso?› yira mamsutiwa yit haphquni Yohannis neeki wosin yaanirwa» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Yesus es kabaasik asuni meyanon showo meroossinnawa kiina ayyanaasonna asusasin kisi. Showo aaftishuni meeni aafaason gachi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Yesus Yohannisnikin wostere yeese baassok: «Hamfaat biiti baronnawa odeti baronna Yohannisnik makoti. Aaftishuni meya biyosone; engitfe baasso kaanne kutusone; awataatoni mettanni meya kayimone; Odoba oyoos odona; kituus kabuna; Tukamni meyak dey Misirachchuni kaamaas maktona. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Ta wostefana wostoosik tuusa'onoy bar suustowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Yohannisni wosiisakito wolle hametenneen orfo Yesus Yohannisni chowaason daraasik: «Siru shorkifana waajosoningwa wedey awu biyatik ichma daa yaatiso? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Wedey keeshu maya mayo asuni meyanonnoso? Ese keeshu maya mayye ge'efe baasso taate meeni keertu feesete. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Eekin awu biyatik kesetiso? Raajjuninnoso? Ese nittok makefawungwa; bar raajjusatan denalowa. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>‹Ese sinneesta hamfaafe ugunneeson sapsuni wositaasin neyistan zeemma wosuna› yistera tichchenaas barwa <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Ta nittok makefawungwa; mashkasu kophena asusa ganesin Yohannisniistan denalo oonu aafewa. Sinuntano Ha'oosi taatosi fe asusasin atees basaastan denalowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Es baron odeseteyse asuni meya zuuttere girbo zuutife baassoneen Yohannisniki yeesere haphuktesere feeseter sinna boor'a Ha'oosi wosto futo sinbaason arsesete. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Sinuntano Ferisawini meenawa Museni tumaasi assinynyana Ha'oosi safaranon tugga'ok Yohannisnik haphukto beyet feeseter.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesus tusire dey: «Han neyaasi koontonon awuneen hoossunarinso? Awune feeseterinso? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Gabata diisefaat bare bare teegsetaafa: ‹Markata fugni aane sursoweti; soosenik aane waassoweti› yiset kassefa naanggotaasne feeseterwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Haphquni Yohannis tusha muunoy wayinini usha ushnoy yeen nitto: ‹Kiina ayyana faarwa› yiseti. <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Asuni Naa meetnawa ushetna yeen: ‹Han bar muunewa ushne shuna asuwa; dey girbo zuutife baassonawa boor'ni meena asi zomowa› yiseti. <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Techmaasi futo sina naanggotba zuuttambaase asiistatu artefa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isa Boor'ba Faana Mashkasu Yesusni Shitto Woshshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Ferisawini meyaassin isar Yesus muu muunak keeba teege. Yesus dey asusa keer hamme muuk di. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Es katamaassi isa boor'inynya asu faar. Bar dey Yesus Ferisawiisa keer foobaason odefaat albastiros yiste shu'ak wosuste bilqadisi shitto ephpha esta hami. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Yesusni orfoosta wochobaasi tesha yerefaat waasit harafbaasik haatira sombaasik ku'et faar. Wochobaason daamet shittok woshshit faar. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Yesusni barki keer teege Ferisawiis es baron biyaat: «Han asu raajju sinfaanane han barin fochfa asus oo sinnamatonawa aro boor'ba faanamatona aruna kabawa» yit nibbaassi safare. <verse eid="LUK 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesus dey: «Simon! Ta neek isa makona wuza faarwa» yi. Bar dey: «Assinynyano; ma'arwa makowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesus dey: «Isa asunikin waaga liqe hep asuni meya feeseterwa. Isaas uuch tiya birri; hepsaas dey uuchasir birri liqsete. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Wolgire kaassone waaga tishfaan kowaason hepobesiise asik beyi. Eekan hepobesiise asiissn liqsi barin akamanon shunnis aafferinso?» yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simon dey: «Akama kowa basaasta beytena bartongwa» yi. Yesus dey: «Wolgita bar futowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Estan Yesus asuski yerqefaat Simoonnik: «Han asuso biitoso? Ta neeki keer girifana kabaasik orgonaasik akanu aane teshshowe. Sinuntano bar wochonaason harafbaasik haatira sombaasik dey ku'i. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Ta neeki keer girifana kabaasik ne taan aane daamowe. Sinuntano bar ta neeki keer girinanneen hang orgonaason daamo aane yeetuwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Ne teetnaason zayitik aane foche. Sinuntano bar orgonaason shittok woshshi. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Es bari boor'a neek makefawungwa; bar akamanon shunna boor'a akama boor'baas feeshun yistewa. Garo boor'baas feeshun yistena bar garonontu shunfewa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Estan Yesus asuson: «Boor'nees feeshun yistewe» yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Barneen ane muu meet diise baasso dey: «Boor'aason feeshun yifees han bar oonso?» yiset nibbesiissi safarsete. <verse eid="LUK 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Sinuntano Yesus asusik: «Amantonees neen fatiwe; maar'on hamme» yi.<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusninnawa Basa Nawoosakitoninna Argasse Mashka Meya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Esseen orfo Yesus katama katamaassinawa ke'e ke'eessina hamfaafe Misirachchuni kaamaason awajet Ha'oosi taatoni chowanon maket feer. Asire heppe nawobaasakito dey ane feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Esiisimato kiina ayyana baassossin kesna mashkasunewa meroossina farse mashkasune ane feeseter. Baassossin dey naafun kiina ayyana barissin kesna Megdelawit sinfa Maarami; <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Taato Herodisni keyaason ha'sife Kuuzani asu Yohanna, Soossinanewa ooma showo mashkasune dey feeseter. Es baasso Yesusninnawa nawobaasakitoninna waagbesiisik argasset feeseter.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meeni Bukinynyani Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Showo dara dey katama katamaassin barki yeesere zuuttesefe kabaasik Yesus han besoson baassok make:<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>«Isa bulinynya zala bukanak kesi. Bukfena kabaasik isa isa zalaas ugnaasta zigira yete. Kasaas dey ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Ooma zalaas kaa'oosta wor'i. Kayifana kabaasik haar'ba tishina boor'a ichimi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Ooma zalaas dey seer'aasi ganesi wor'i. Seer'aas ane kayira geer'a tishki. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Ooma zalaas ma'a ho'aassi wor'i. Kayira dichcha tiya kushunon daysira gaani» yi. Es baron makere koi'sinaase kaambaason teggire: «Odoba feenaas odowowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Nawobaasakito Yesusnin: «Han besos kotba aambanso?» yire mamussete. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Yesus dey ekka yire baassok wolgi: «Ha'oosi taatoni aacho chowanon arutik nittok imtewa. Sinuntano oomni meyak chowa zuuttera besoktu maktefawa. Baasso biyefet aane yaadatesefe. Odefet dey aane gasasisefe. <verse eid="LUK 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>Besosi kota haniiswa. Zalaas Ha'oosi kaamawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Ugnaasi ha'ta wor'a zalaas kaambaason odefe asuni meyawa. Sinuntano baasso amanere farsonoytemato Daabulos yeere Ha'oosi kaamanon nibbesiissin ephfe. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Kaa'oosta wor'a bar kaambaason odesefe kabaasik girak ephpheteesefe baassowa. Amantobesiis es kabaasik sinfaat tasba aafa sinna boor'a fatana kar'fana kabaasik tai'nintu kaadesefe. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Seer'aasi ganesi wor'a zalaas kaambaason odefe baassowa. Sinuntano han daastaki fa fooni safarak, otumni danni safaraasnawa ma'a fooni ge'aas geer'a gaanbesi foonto zagifa. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Ma'a ho'aassi wor'a zalaas ma'a tuuma nibak kaambaason odere wostota feeshife baassowa. Kaambaasik zagire gaana gaaneter.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tega Dimta Di Tona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>«Tona tonire waashshi wedey kuphoni sikalosi duusife asu aafe. Sinuntano keer girife asu chaarefaason biyanak tega dimtatu duusifewa. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Ammanon kesnor aacho, artonor chaarefaasta kesnoy aacho wuza aafawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Ese aakkak odotimato gasasutiwa. Feena barik dayistera imtona. Sinuntano isa wuzba foontoos taak faarwa yifena barnu basaastan ootter» yi.<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Intoosewa Ayiisakitona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Yesusni intoosewa aybaasakitona barki yeesete. Sinuntano daraasa showotan kabi chowa barin uphok aane chimoto. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Asuni meya Yesusnik: «Intoneesewa ayneesakitona neen biyak sholere gero yersefewa» yire maksete.<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Yesus dey: «Intonaasewa aytaasakitona Ha'oosi kaamanon odesere wostota feeshife baassowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Ipuwaason Shaakkunak Zagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Isa wono Yesus basa nawoosakitoneen goonuusta diifaat: «Han baarisi yesalo finaniwa» yi. Baasso dey finak kabsete. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Baariista hamefeen Yesus afay'ni kuni. Es kabaasik akaasta akama ipuwa kabi. Aka goonuussi tuumet hambaase zuuttambesiise asin tiir'o ephi. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Es kabaasik nawobaasakito: «Daamiiso! Daamiiso! Ko'unirwa!» yit Yesusnin guzgisete. Bar dey guzire ipuwaasewa akaasi guubone asin ke'in geregere shaakki dey akama naga sini. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Esseen orfo Yesus baassok: «Amantontiis ayfaso?» yi. Sinuntano baassotna baassotna digaknawa diinqokna: «Ipuwaasewa akaasi guubone ajajamenar han bar oonso?» yisesete.<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kiina Ayyana Basaassi Ha'ina Asusin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Baariison finere Galiilaki daasi yesalo fa Gerasenon kar'ete. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Yesus goonuussin daa kerefena kabaasik kiina ayyana basaassi faana isa asu katamaassin kesse uphe. Es asus maybaason gaa'e ha'aat atatu kutu ephna wonaas woki. Feefenaas dey moogni biratotatano keerta. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28-29"/>Yesus kiina ayyanaason asusasin kesanak ke'ina boor'a barin biinayse sinba gandera kaambaason teggira: «Ne zuuttambaase asiistan denalo sina Ha'oosi naa Yesusno! Taneen awuni isarne faarinso? Adarawa taan kiichutaatawa!» yit chaagi. Akama neya basaassi diir sinna boor'a shashsharaknawa wochoni ginokna taatere oodtet feer. Sinuntano Shashsharaason buggit wochoni ginooson kiir'et feer. Kiina ayyanaas dey ichma daa ephpha hamet faar.<verse eid="LUK 8:28-29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesus dey: «Ne sunne oonso?» yire mamsi. Showo kiina ayyana girira faar sinna boor'a: «Legewon» yire wolgi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Kiina ayyanaasikito dey: «Inya gawuussi innotin kalla gafkutaatawa» yit Yesusnin shiiphse.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Es dimaasta fa kumaasi teshta showo muko yerefaat maadifar. Kiina ayyanaasikito: «Ek mukoossi girunik ajajowa» yira Yesusni shiiphse. Bar dey: «Hamma giruti» yi. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Kiina ayyanaasikito asusasin kessa mukoosikitosi girise. Mukoosikito dey kumaastan sharastet baariissi girira koote.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Mukooson keemfe keemeriisakito sina chowaason biyefaat eelere hamme katama katamaassinawa ke'e ke'eessina maksete. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Asuni meya dey zagte chowaason biyak keebesi keebesiissin kesere Yesusniki yeesete. Showo kiina ayyana basaassin kesna asus nibba wolin maya mayye Yesusni wochoosi tesha diifen biyere digesete. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Showo kiina ayyanaas basaassin kesna asus aakkak farinamato aafak biya baasso asuni meyak maksete. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Esseen orfo Gergesenonki asuni meya zuuttere akamanon digsete boor'a Yesus estan hamanak shiiphsete. Yesus dey goonuussi diire wolle hami. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Showo kiina ayyana basaassin kesna asus: «Neneen ane hamanawa» yit Yesusnin shiiphe. Sinuntano Yesus ekka yit makere gafki:<verse eid="LUK 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>«Keene wolla hamfaat Ha'o neek zagina chowaason zuutira makowa» Asus dey Yesus barik zagina chowaason katamaassi kutifaat maket hami.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiti Nawaasi Kabunewa Mettana Asusi Farune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Dara zuuttere Yesusnin oodet feeseter sinna boor'a wolle yeefena kabaasik girak ephpheteesete. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Es kabaasik Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi gaanynya sunba Iyyaros yiste asu ye. Yesusni wochoossi gandere barki keer hamanak shiiphe. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Neebaas asire heppe sinna isa mashka nawubaas mettera kituk kar'a faar sinna boor'atu es baron zagi. Yesus barneen ane hamfena kabaasik ane hamfe daraas ugnaason tiir'sire tugit feer. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Asire heppe neya barissin hanna wuuktet faana isa mashkasu dey faar. Bar dey fa waagbaason zuutira hetni asunik koi'si. Oonu baron fatuk aane chime. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Bar dey orfo kamo yaara Yesusni maamaasi fashanon ta'i. Geregere wuuktet fa harinbaas yere. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesus dey: «Taan ta'i oonso?» yire mamsi. Zuuttere: «Inno aane ta'uweniwa» yisete. Phexiros dey: «Daamiiso, dara zuuttere neen ganeya gedde tugire tiir'sifeen biifat taan ta'iis oonso?» yifatoso.<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Hugna taaysin kesnamato aringwa, futoosik isa asu taan ta'iwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Mashkasus dey aachonoy korkit yaara Yesusni sina sagade. Awuniron barin ta'inamatonawa aakkak geregere farinamatona dara zuuttambaase asi sinak make. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yesus asusik: «Naanaase amantonees neen fatiwe. Nagak hamme» yi.<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Yesus es baron makefeen isa asu Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi gaanynya Iyyarosni keerun yeere: «Naane kitiwa. Hanneen ekalo assinynyaasin baak hopsutaatawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Sinuntano Yesus es baron odere Iyyarosnin: «Harewa! Digotaata. Amantowa, Naanees farunawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Yesus Iyyarosni keer kar'fena kabaasik barneen ane giriis Phexiros, Yohannis, Yaqobnawa nawaasi abaneen intoneentano oom barneen girsonek aane sholowe. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Asu zuuttere: «Yi! Yi!» yit waassedifer. Sinuntano Yesus: «Waasutiita, nawaas kunutu kunitano aane kituwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Asuni meya nawaas kitubaason arsete boor'a Yesusniista mi'esete. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Sinuntano Yesus kushubaason zatte: «Han Nawaase kabuwe» yi. <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Nawaas dey kaaba wolin geregere kabira di. Yesus dey: «muuna muuba imotiwa» yire ajaje. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Kooni abaasnawa intoose diinqesete. Sinuntano Yesus sina chowaason ooknu maksonoytemato ajaje.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Assire Heppe Nawobaasakitonin Wosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesus asire heppe wosini meyanon barki teegere kiina ayyanaason asuniissin kissoneknawa mero zuuttambaase asiissin fatusonekna giidonewa ha'suni hugnane baassok imi. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Esiisimato dey Ha'oosi taatoni kaamanon asu zuuttambaase asik maksoneknawa mettanni meyanon fatusonekna wosi. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Ekka dey yi: «Ugunnitiisik sinni haaro sinun, ha'mato sinun, tusha sinun, waaga sinun, mayti baristan oomanon daysira ephpha hamatiita. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Es giriti katamaassin kesatinneen zeemma giriti keyaassi footi. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Asuni meya nittotin ephphetoo beyefaatene estan kesfeti kabaasik orgontiisi tulooson tebira wootuti. Es bar dey baassosta zaala sinana» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Wosini meya dey kesere misirachchuni kaamaason maket mettaniisin fatit ke'e ke'eessi aatet feeseter.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Isa isa asuni meya: «Haphqife Yohannis kitun kabiwa» yiset feeseter sinna boor'a Galiilaki daason ha'sife Herodis Yesus zagina chowaason zuutire odere ephphe zaguna wuza daage. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Esiisimato isa isa asuni meya: «Raajju Eeliyas wolle yewa» yiseten, oomiis dey: «Zeemoti raajjuni meyaassin isaas kitun kabiwa» yiset feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Herodis dey: «Haphqife Yohannisnin ta suutbaason katira woringwa. Eekin han odefana bar oonso?» yi. Aaffaasik dey biyanak shole.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Uuch Kum Asunin Maasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoha. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Wosini meya hameteessin wolle yeesere zagsete wuzason zuutire Yesusnik maksete. Bar dey Betesayida yistefa katamaasi tesha fa shaato dima baasso baassotin ephphe hami. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Daraas dey Yesus ay hamdifenamato arifaat baasso orfoose hamete. Yesus dey shunne Ha'oosi taatoni chowanon baassok assi. Meroossin faruk sholsere yeese baassotin dey fati.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Gero waalfana kabaasik asire heppe nawobaasakito Yesusniki yeesere: «Han faani dimaas ichma daawa. Es bari boor'a daraas biratoosta fa katamaassinawa beedesina hamme muunewa kununi dimne sholsonek gafkuwa» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Yesus wolgire: «Nitto muusone baron baassok imtiwa» yi. Baasso dey wolugsere: «Innoki fayiis uuch muuma tushnewa hep kurxumminewa. Es bar dey hamma waagera daysu shakaanine han effe daraasik aafawa hoorona wuza» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Estak uuch kum sinni arqasu feer.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesus nawobaasakitonik: «Uuchasir uuchasir zagira bag bagga duusutiwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Baasso dey Yesus makenaasimato duusisete. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Estan uuch muuma tushaasewa hep kurxummiise kabgire den sama kaanne Ha'o galattefaat batte daraasik haa'onek nawobaasakitonik imi. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Dara zuuttere meere gawi. Nawoni meya dey fu'te battooson zuutiseten asire heppe masa tuuma kabi.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Yesus Kiristoos Sinnamato Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat. 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar. 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Isa wona Yesus bar bar Ha'o shiiphefeen nawobaasakito barki yeesere feeseter. Yesus dey baassotin: «Asuni meya taan oo yisefeso?» yire mamsi.<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Baasso dey wolgire: «Isa isaas haphquni Yohanniswa. Isa isaas Eeliyas, dey oomiis zeemoti raajjuni meyaassin isaas kitun kabiwa yisefewa» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Baassok dey: «Eekan nitto taan oo yifetiso?» yire mamsi. Phexiros wolgire: «Ne Ha'okin wostere ye Kiristooswa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Yesus baassok: «Es baron ooknu makotiita» yit chinire make.<verse eid="LUK 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Tusire dey: «Asuni Naa akama shana ephphetoonak sholsuwa. Esiis dey kur'uni meyak, maagni gaanynyanik, Museni tumaasi assinynyanik kashistona dey wortona. Keessinari wono dey kitun kabuna» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Estan dey zuuttambesiise asik: «Taneen ane hamak sholefe bar oonu sinfaanane basa teetni chowaason beyo. Wonna wonna mesqelibaason wor'e taneen ane yowowa. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Kaabaason fu'ok sholefe bar zuuttere kaabaason tishkuna. Taakwa iyaat kaabaason aatire imfe bar kaabaason fu'ona. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Asu zuuttere han daastaki otmaason danaat kaabaason tishkaanane wedey yoi'gaanane barik awu ke'nirinso? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Oonu sinfaanane taaknawa ta kaamaasikna iichchefe bar Asuni Naa basa ulfintoosiknawa samaki Ababaasa ulfintokna dey korto Ha'oosi wosiyaasikitoni ulfinak yeefena kabaasik barik iichchona. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa, hanta yeese baasso ganeyaassin Ha'oosi taatonon biyonoy kitunor feeseterwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Gito Soolte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Yesus es baron makena nangirin wonaneen orfo Phexirosnin, Yohannisninnawa Yaqobninna zoonsire Ha'o shiiphonak isa aamta kesi. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Estak shiiphefeen sinbaasi gitobaas soolte. Maambaas dey forera palpalli. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Geregere hep asu Musenawa Eeliyasna Yesusneen uphere wolumsete. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Ulfinak ammanon bestesere Yesus Yerusalemuk shana ephphetoonamatonawa kitunamatona wolumsesete. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Sinuntano Phexiros barneen ane fe baassona afay' ephaan kuneter. Guzisere Yesusni ulfinaasonnawa barneen ane wolet fe hep asuni meyanonna biyete. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Es ane wolumset fe asuni meya Yesusniistan oor kesere hamefe kabaasik Phexiros: «Daamiiso hanta foos innok ma'arwa. Keez hafo ha'uniwa. Isar neer, Isar Musenir, Isar dey Eeliyasnir» yi. Sinuntano awu makedifenamato aane aruwe.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Phexiros es baron makefeen shaaru yaara baassotin yini. Shaaruus yinifana kabaasik digesete. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Shaaruussi kamo: «Ta korina naataas haniiswa. Barin odotiwa» yifa kaama ya. <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Es kaamaas odtenanneen orfo Yesus bar bar beste. Nawobaasakito dey biyete wuzason es kabaasik ooknu maksonoy shaakkisete.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kiina Ayyana Basaassi Ha'ina Naasin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat. 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar. 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Wonotiri wono aamaastan kersetenneen orfo showo dara Yesusnik huphe. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Es daraasa ganesin isa asu ekka yit chaagi: «Assinynyano, han bar taak isa naatawa; yaara biyatak shiiphefawungwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Kiina ayyanaas barin chaagsir. Daasta gansira dey tookonak zagira gusa kar'ar. Atubaason mazasira Miir'enanneen orfo akama shanak beyfa. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Ne nawoosakito es kiina ayyanaason naasasin kissonek shiiphena aane chimoto.»<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesus esta fe daraasin: «Amantonti foonto elinga koonto, aageneen kar'a nittoneen ane foonari? Aageneen kar'a nittotin fa kunarinso? Naaneesin hang teshshebbo» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Naas hang Yesusniki tai'sefena kabaasik kiina ayyanaas naasin daasta gansin tooke. Sinuntano Yesus kiina ayyanaason ke'ire naasin fatire ababaasik imi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Asuni meya zuuttere Ha'oosi akama hugnanon biyesete boor'a diinqesete.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesus Basa Kituusi Chowanon Hepsa Make</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar. 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Asu zuuttere Yesus zagina wuzaasik diinqesefeen Yesus Nawobaasakitonik ekka yi: <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>«Han makefana kaamaason gazgira odotiwa. Asuni Naa asuni meeni kushusi aattere imtonirwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Sinuntano es bar makena bar aane baassok galowa. Es wollaasi aacho chowanon arsonek aane chimoto. Wolgire mamsuk dey digsete.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Arkir Oonso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar. 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Nawobaasakitoni ganesi: «Innoossin oonso arkiri?» uni karakkaro kabi. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Sinuntano Yesus baasso nibaasi safaranon arifaat isa garo naanin teshshere teshba yeeti. <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>Estan baassok: «Han garo naasin ta sunaasik ephphete bar oonu sinfaanane taan ephphetoonawa. Taan ephphete bar wosi Abataasin dey ephphetoonawa. Nitto ganeyaassin atees zuuttamnitiise asiistan arkirwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 9:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Yohannis dey Yesusnin: «Daamiiso, isa asu ne sunaasik kiina ayyanaason asunisin kisifeen biira innoneen ane sina beyna boor'a kalniwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yesus wolgire: «Nittotin oomtonoy bar zuuttere nittoneen ane sinna boor'a kalatiitawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samariyaki Asuni Meya Yesusnin Ephphetoo Beyete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Yesus den sama hamana wona kar'baase Yerusalem hamanak budire kabi. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Basaastan zeemme sina hamni wosinin gafki. Baasso dey sholsuuson zuutire hoossusonek Samariyaki fa isa ke'esi kar'ete. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Sinuntano Yerusalem hamnir sinbaaso araat asuni meya aane ephphetoosoto. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Nawobaasasin Yaqobnawa Yohannisna es baron biyaat: «Daamiiso, den saman geya kerera baassotin kiichunak ajajonik ma'i utaroso?» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Sinuntano Yesus yerqere baassotin ke'i. [Aro tesa ayyana nittoneen ane faanamato aane aruwetiwa. Asuni Naa yeenaas asuni kaani fatuktano tishkuktawa.] <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Estan kabsere ooma ke'esi hamete.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusneen Ane Hama Waaga Kaasisir</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat. 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona ugunne hamefeen isa asu: «Ne hamta hamtaassi neneen ane hamanak sholefaungwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesus wolgire: «Bowasikito dooi'ba faarwa. Kasaas dey keeba faarwa, sinuntano Asuni Naa teetbaasonnu teesuna dimba aafawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Dey oom asunin: «Taneen hamniwa» yi. Asus dey: «Daamiiso, zeemma hamma abataasin kabbaronak ma'i uwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yesus wolgire: «Kituni meya kitubesiison kabbarsonek beywa. Sinuntano ne hamma Ha'oosi taatoni chowanon makowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Oom asu dey: «Daamiiso neneen ane hamanawa. Sinuntano zeemma hamma taaki keerki asuni meyanon maar'on footi unak ma'i uwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yesus dey: «Gachuni boda ephaat orfo yerqefe asu Ha'oosi taatok sholsutewa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Naafunasire Heppe Nawoni Meyanon Wosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Esseen orfo Daamiis oom naafunasire heppe asuni korire bar hamana katamaassinawa ke'e zuuttambaase asiissina zeemme hamonek hep hep zagire gafki. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Ekka dey yi: «Ese Foshaas tagawa. Sinuntano zuutuni wostinynyani meya garowa. Es bari boor'a foshaasi aba wostinynyani meyanon daysire gafkunak shiiphotiwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Ese hamtiwa! Nittotin fantunimato zagira iririkaasi ganesi wosunawa. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Ugunnitiisik sinni waagni kar'diddi sinun, ha'mato sinun, chaa'ma sinun ephatiita. Ugnaasta yerera ooninnu sinfaanane naga ooshshotiita. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Aaffa keernu girifeti kabaasik zeemma: ‹Naga han keyaasik sinfawungwa› uti. <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Es keyaassi naga shuna asu feefaanane nagantiis es asusasi foona. Ekka sina shakaanane nagantiis nittokitu woluna. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Wostinynya wostobaasi waaganon dananak sholsuwa. Es bari boor'a zeemmati giriti keyaassi faafaat imete baron maatnawa ushetna footi. Isa keerun isa keer hamatiita. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Aaffa katamaassinu girifeti kabaasik asuni meya nittotin keebesiissi ephpheteere imete baron muusoti. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Es katamaassi fe mettaniisakitonin fatuti. Daraasik dey: ‹Ha'oosi taato nittoki tai'sewa› yit makoti. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Sinuntano aaffa katamaassi hamma girini asuni meya nittotin ephphe too beyefatene katamani dara zuuttefena yaboosta kesfaat: <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‹Wochoniista fa katamantiisi tulonon han yaboosta nittok tebuniwa. Sinuntano Ha'oosi taato nittoki ta'baason arutiwa› <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Nittok makefawungwa, mangsuni kar'ni wono es katamaastaki kar'ni mangsuni kar'aastan Sodomni katamaasta kar'ni mangsuni kar'aastu kashowa.<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>«Haybunewe Korazin! Haybunewe Beetesayidane! Nittoosta zagte biistera artonoy wuzaas Tirosniistanawa Sidonaniistana zagte sinfaanane zeemme ibe mangsubesiissin wolsere suumoni maama mayere bedna wochisere harmusone kabawe. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Es bari boor'a mangsuni kar'ni wono nittoostan Tirosiknawa Sidonakna kashotu sinana. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Kifirnahomne! Den sama teguk sholetose? Wolla yeet ke'oni dimaassitu kerotawe.<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>«Nittotin ode bar taan dey odona. Nittotin ephphetoo beya bar taan aafa ephphetoona wuza. Taan ephphetoo beya bar dey taan wosi barin aafa ephphetoona wuza.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Wostere hama naafunasire heppe asuni meya girak wolle yeesete. Yesusnik dey: «Daamiiso, kiina ayyanaasnu ne sunaasik ajachchewa» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Sexanaas kawunnimato den saman kere wor'difen biingwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Ese zawasewa gamzatoose asin yer'atik gumantiisa hugna zuuttambaase asiista ha'suni hugna imingwa. Nittotin miir'oni wuza isanne aafawa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Sinuntano kiina ayyanaas nittok ajachchobaasik girotiitawa. Sunnitiis den sama tichchobaasik girotiwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Es kabaasik Yesus Korto Ayyanani girak tuumme: «Samaasewa daase asi Daam sina Abataaso, han baron zuutira techumni meyakinnawa aruna meyakinna aachira han daag asuni meyak ammanon besita boor'a neen galattefawungwa. Aa, Abataaso, han bar ne ma'a safaraasik siniwa.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>«Zuuttambaase Abataaskin taak imtewa. Naas oo sinnamato Abaasteno oonu arifer aafe. Esiisimato dey Abaas oo sinnamato naas wedey bar amma besunak sholena barteno oom oonu arifer aafe» yi.<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Dey Yesus nawobaasakitoniki yerqere baasso baassok: «Han nitto biifeti baron biife baasso suustowa. <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Nittok makefawungwa, showo raajjuni meenawa taate meena han nitto biifeti baron biyonek sholset feeseter. Sinuntano aane biyoto. Nitto odefeti baron odosonek sholset feeseter. Sinuntano aane odosoto» yi.<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kenashto Samirawisa Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Isa wono Museni tumaasi aru Yesusniki ye. Barin fattanonak sholefaat: «Assinynyano, koi'ba foonto kaa dananak awu zagunak sholsifaso?» yire mamsi. <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesus wolgire: «Tumaassi awu yisteranso tichchenari? Feretira aro aru danisso?» yi.<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Asus wolgire: « ‹Tumaas makefanaas Daama Ha'oneeson tuuma nibneesik, tuuma kaaneesik, tuuma hugnaneesiknawa tuuma safaraneesikna shungwa› Dey: ‹Asu zuuttambaase asin ne ne teetaason shunfataasimato shungwa› yisteratu tichchewa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesus dey: «Ma'arontu wolgitwa. Ese ne dey esiisimato zaguwa. Koi'ba foonto kaa dey danatawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Sinuntano asus teetbaason ooko zaguk sholefaat: «Asu zuuttambaase oonso?» yi.<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesus ekka yire wolgi: «Isa asu Yerusalemun kabire Iyyariko hamfeen ugunta bo'inynyani meya danere maybaason gaa'e ichche kaa kaak ha'aat hamete. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Diinqone isa maag es ugnaasik hamaas ichchere kuni asusin biyaat shaatere hami. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Esiisimato dey isa Lewi es ugnaasik hamaas biyaat shaatere hami. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Isa Samariyani asu es ugnaasik hamaas asusin dani. Asusin biinayse barik kenashte. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Ek barki tai'sere mazabaasta woyinini ushnewa zayitine woshshire taar'i. Estan basa hanyaasta duusire irbani ha'ifena keer taamme kati. Estak mettaniisik sholsuuson zagi. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Wonotirik hep diinari kisire es irbani keyaasi abanik imaat: ‹Han asusin oodda metissuwa. Han imna baristan denalo waaga kisaatane ta yaafana kabaasik kaasuna› yi. <verse eid="LUK 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Eekin bo'inynyaasa kushusi ichchere gande asusik ma'a wuza zagiis aaffer sinna neek bestefaso?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Tumaasi aru: «Es barik kenashtere argasi barwa» yire wolgi. Yesus dey: «Ese ne dey hamfaat esiisimato zaguwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Maartanewa Maaramine Asi Keer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Yesus basa nawoosneen ugunne hamere isa ke'esi kar'i. Es ke'eessi Maarta yiste isa asu barin keeba ephpha hami. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Bar dey Maarami yiste eetba faar. Maarami dey Yesus makefena baron odet wochobaassi diifar. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Sinuntano Maarta wostoba arkina boor'a diira odok aane chima. Yesusniki yaara: «Daamiiso, eetnaas wostooson ta tayista ha'aat diifana kabaasik shaakkira biifa toso? Taan argasunak makowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Maartane, Maartane, showo wuzak rakkatedifatarwe. Tiir'o dey neen ephiwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Sinuntano sholsuus isa wuza koi'bawe. Maarami ma'a wuza koriwe. Es baron dey baristan ephnir oonu aafe» yire wolgi.<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Assina Shiipho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat. 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Isa wono Yesus isa dimta Ha'o shiiphet feer. Shiiphphobaason koi'sifena kabaasik nawobaasakitonisin isaas: «Daamiiso, Yohannis nawobaasakitonik Ha'oni shiipho assinaasimato ne dey innotin Ha'oni shiipho assuwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yesus dey: «Shiiphefeti kabaasik ekka utiwa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">« ‹Samak fe Abaniiso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">sunnees ulfintefawungwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">taatonees yoongwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Wona wonaasik sholsu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:3">muuniison innok imma;<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Innotin miir'e baassotin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">feeshun yifeniisimato;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">mangsuniison innok feeshun uwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">fatanasi innotin gedataata›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">[manguussin fu'otano]» yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Tusire dey Yesus nawobaasakitonik: «Isa beso, nittoossin isar zomoba feenari, wassi daani ganeyak zomobaaski hamme: ‹Zomotaaso keez muuma tusha taak liqessaywa. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Isa zomota ugnan taaki yewa. Barik imana muu tishiwa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Es zomobaas keer kunigedo: ‹Taan hopsutaatawa. Gamalaas kuluftewa. Naanggotnaas dey taneen kunirwa. Kabira imanak aane chimut uninnoso?› <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Nittok makefawungwa; zomoba sinna boor'a kabire ima beyfenak shimsubaasi boor'a kabire sholena baron zuutire imanawa.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>«Es bari boor'a ta dey nittok makonaas haniiswa: Shiiphphoti, nittok imtona. Sholoti, danati. Gamalaason ki'ti, nittok gachchona. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Shiiphphefe bar zuuttere ephphetoona. Sholefe bar dey danana. Gamalaason ki'fe barik gachchona. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Nitto ganeyaassin aba sinfaat nawubaas [tusha shiiphphen shu'a imnir oonso?] kurxummi shiiphphen zawa imnir fooniroso? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Wedey akoni kewa shiiphen gamzato imniroso? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Nitto mangu asu sinfaat naanggotnitiisik ma'a wuza ima arifaatine samak fe abantiis eekin shiiphefe baassok Korto Ayyanaason aakkak arkissire ima beynirinso!» yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Beelzebulna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat. 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mar. 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Isa wona Yesus niba taar'a kiina ayyana isa nibtaato asunisin kisit feer. Kiina ayyana kesnanneen orfo asus wollo ephi. Daraas dey es sina chowaasik diinqesete. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Sinuntano daraasasin isa isaas: «Kiina ayyanaason kisifenaas bari gaanynya sina Beelzebulnikwa» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Oomiis dey Yesusnin fattanok den saman isa mallato besunak mamussete. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Sinuntano Yesus nibbesiisi safaranon arifaat: «Isa taato bagtera bare bare oor oor kesfaanane es taatoos tishirwa. Esiisimato dey isa keerki asu oor oor kesfaanane gander. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Nitto taan: ‹Bar kiina ayyanaason kisifenaas bari gaanynya sina beelzebulnikwa› yitiwa. Sexana bare bare oor oor kesar sinfaanane taatobaas aakkak yeronirinso? <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Ese ta kiina ayyanaason kisifanaas Beelzebulnik sinfaanane nitto naanggotaasikito ooni sunak kissongaso? Es bari boor'a nitto naanggotaas nittoosta mangsu kar'nirwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Sinuntano ta kiina ayyanaason kisifanaas Ha'oni hugnak sinfaanane Ha'oosi taato nittoki yoobaason arutiwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Isa zag asu fa neeboni meebaason zuutire taar'ere keebaason oodfaanane fa waagbaas mai'siratu oodtonawa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Sinuntano basaastan denalo chim asu yeere merefaanane es teetena neeboni meebaason kossire fa waagbaason boojere taamme haa'arwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>Taneen ane sinnoy bar taan oomterwa. Taneen ane zuutunoy bar sikerwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>«Kiina ayyanaas asusasin kesfana kabaasik beysa ephana dima sholet aka foonto ichma daassi biratefa. Turkifana kabaasik: ‹Zeemoti kesna keenaassi wolunawa› yifa. <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Wolla yaafana kabaasik keyaas futtera hoorera feen danfa. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Esseen orfo hamma ooma baristan akamanon manguuson naafun zagira ephpha yaara girira diifa. Es asusik zeemmatiistan orfoti bar akamanon mangu sinfa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yesus es baron makefeen daraasa ganesin isa mashkasu kaambaason teggira: «Neen naanerte magaasewa tamta tamaase suustowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Sinuntano Yesus wolgire: «Suustoos Ha'oosi kaamanon odere wostota feeshife baassowe» yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yonasni Mallato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat. 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Showo asuni meya yeesere Yesusniki zuutteseten ekka yi: «Han koontoos mangu koontowa. Mallato biyaktu sholefa. Sinuntano raajju Yonasni maallatoostan ooma mallato aafa imtona wuza. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Raajju Yonas Neneweki asuni meyak mallato sinnaasimato Asuni Naa dey han koontoosik mallato sinana. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Kawudaaki taatono Solomonni techmaason odok daasi dilsin kabira ya. Es bari boor'a mangsuni kar'ni wono han koontoosneen kabira baassosta mangsu kar'ana. Sinuntano Solomonniistan denalo hanta feerwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Neneweki asuni meya mangsu kar'ni wono han koontoosneen kabire baassosta mangsu kar'oner. Baasso Yonas makena Ha'oosi kaamanon odesere boor'besiissin harmisete. Ese dey Yonasniistan denalo hanta feerwa.»<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atuni Tona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Tona tonire aacho dimsi wedey gupkosi duusife asu aafe. Sinuntano keer girife asusik chaarsunak tega dimtatu duusife. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Atuneesi tona aafneeswa. Aafnees fayya sinfaanane atune zuuttera chaarefatu sinana. Sinuntano aafnees mettana sinfaanane atune zuuttera talmatu sinana. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Es bari boor'a neyissi fa chaarefaas talmonoynamato aruwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Ese atune zuuttera chaarefak tuumma talma foonto sinfaanane atunees zuuttera mai'sira saamfa tonnimatotu chaaronawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Ferisawini Meenawa Tumaasi Arinynyana Asin Ke'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Es baron makefeen isa Ferisawi muu muunak Yesusnin barki keer teege. Ferisawiisa keer girire ane muu muunak di. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Yesus muu muunoy zeemme kushubaason maso beyna boor'a Ferisawiis diinqe. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Estan Daamiis barik ekka yi: «Nitto Ferisawiis, toofosewa koranaase asi tukanontu kayimsira masefeti. Sinuntano sikalontiis bo'aknawa mangukna tuumawa. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Nitto gowwa, tukabaason tesi Ha'oos sikalobaason aane tesuwanoso? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Ese toofontiissi fa baronnawa koranantiissi fa baronna tukamiisik imtiwa. Es kabaasik zuuttambaase nittok kayma sinana.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>«Nitto Ferisawiis haybuntiwa! Azmachaassinnawa chirataassinna esiisimato dey fuso fuso sausaassin asiriissin isaron Ha'ok imtir. Sinuntano futoni wostoosonnawa Ha'oosi keeshtananonna beytiwa. Es baron zagaat han baron beyti bar ma'artawa.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>«Nitto Ferisawiis haybuntiwa! Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassik ulfinni kodta duuktu sholefeti. Gabaasta dey asu nittotin arkissuni naga ooshshonak sholefetiwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Asuni meya arunoy tukabaasta kutisefe moogane feer sinti boor'a haybuntiwa!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Tumaasi arunisin isaas: «Assinynyano, ekka unees innotinnu mei'tiwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesus wolgire: «Tumaason arife nitto dey haybuntiwa! Asu wor'ak chimnoyna faya ba'a asuniista wossitir. Sinuntano nitto teetnitiisik kushuntiisi waa'aknu aane ta'ifeti. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Esiisimato dey nitto abaasakito worsete raajjuni meeni moogaason gadasifeti boor'a haybuntiwa! <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Ese nitto abaasakito worsete raajjuni meeni moogaason gadasifeti boor'a nitto dey baasso wostesete wostoosik isar sinnitiisontu besifetiwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Es bari boor'a Ha'oosi techma ekka yiwa: ‹Raajjuni meyanonnawa wosini meyanonna wosunawa. Baasso isa isaasin worsone. Oomiisin dey kalle kofuksone. <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Daa testenanneen kabira wuukte raajjuni meeni hannaasik Han koontoos mamustonirwa› <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; Abelni hannaastaneen kabira shoo'aastanawa betemeqdesiissi ganesina wuukte Zakkariyasni hannaasta kar'ananneen han koontoos mamustonirwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>«Tumaasi arife nitto haybuntiwa! Aruni gamalaasi gachonon ephti, sinuntano nitto teetaasik aane giruweti. Giruni baassotin dey kaletiwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53-54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53-54"/>Estan Yesusnin noonobaassin kesfa kaamaasik barin fattanok Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa Ferisawini meena oomtoknawa showo mamsuni mamsukna kabsete.<verse eid="LUK 11:53-54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Tane Fe Asu Aafe Yife Ferisawini Meyakin Teetnitiison Oodtiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat. 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Es kabaasik showo kum dara zuuttesete. Showobesiistan kabi chowa baassotna baassotna tugset feeseter. Yesus zeemme nawobaasakitonik ekka yi: «Ferisawini meeni masoossin esiis dey sinnoy sinne bestoossin teetnitiison oodtiwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Geepto wuzaas ammanon kesa aafa beyana wuza. Aacho wuzaas dey arto aafa beyana wuza. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Es bari boor'a talmaassi wolleti bar zuuttera chaarefaasta odtona. Aacho dimsi saaksera wolleti bar dey tega dimta ammano maktona.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oonin Digonik Sholsifanamato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat. 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>«Zomota sina nittok ekka yifawungwa, ashnitiison woraat esseen orfo ooma wuza zaguk chimonoy baassotin digotiitawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Sinuntano oonin digotik sholsifanamato nittok makonawa. Worinanneen orfo geeni tir'maassi ha'uk hugnaba faana Ha'ooson digotiwa; aa bar baron digotiwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>«Uuch meejmar hep duudesi waagtertanoso? Barissin isaasnu Ha'oosi sina aane daagtefawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Nitto somaasi fashanu faadtowa. Es bari boor'a digotiitawa, nitto showo meejmaristan denalowa.»<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosnik Zaalni Mako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat. 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Nittok yifawungwa; asuni sina bar taar sinbaason zaala make barik Asuni Naa dey Ha'oosi wosiyani sinak barik zaal sinne makonawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Asuni sina taan mormefe barin Ha'oosi wosini sinak dey barin mormonawa.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>«Asuni Naanita mei'ni kaama makefe bar oonu boor'baas feeshun ustonawa. Sinuntano Korto Ayyanaasta mei'ni kaama makefe basa boor'baas aafa feeshun ustona wuza.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>«Asuni meya nittotin Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasikitosi wedey gaannye meyakinawa daa ha'sife baassokina ephphe taamefe kabaasik: ‹Awu wollonittaaso wedey aakkak wolgunittaaso› yit rakkatotiita. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Es kabaasik Korto Ayyanaas makoti baron nittok assunawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gowwa Otum Asu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Daraasa ganesin isa asu Yesusnin: «Assinynyano, aytaas abaniisa karranon taak haa'anak makowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Sinuntano Yesus wolgire: «Ne han asu, nittoosta gaanynya wedey abantiisa karranon haa'anak zagi oonso?» yi. <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Dey tusire: «Asuni kaa teetenaas waagni aatamtantawa. Es bari boor'a eenantoostan teetnitiison oodtiwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Estan tusire isa beso ekka yit make: «Buloba akama gaana gaanna isa otum asu feer. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Es asus dey: ‹Han effatena meenaason zuutira gaagana dima aafa sinna boor'a awu zagunarinso?› yit nibbaassi safare. <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Dey ekka yi: ‹Fa botonaasikitono zuutira bogga ha'aat ooma taga taga boto mar'a meenaasonnawa fa wuznaasonna zuutira gaaganawa› <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Esseen orfo ta taa teetaasik wolgira: ‹Showo neya kar'a hooroni otumna zuutin. Ese kaanaase diira muu, ush, giro una› yi. <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Sinuntano Ha'oos barin: ‹Ne gowwa, hawungti waalaasik kaanees oottonirwa. Ese ne han zuutita bar oonik sinnirinso?› yi.<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>«Esiisimato han daastak teetbaasik otma zuutife bar Ha'oosi sina tukam sina asus esiisne feerwa.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanto Ha'oosta Zagu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat. 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Estan Yesus nawobaasakitonik: «Nittok yifawungwa, kaantiisik muuti baron wedey atuntiista mayati barik tiir'o ephanaatawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Esiis dey kaa muustan, atu mayaastan denalowa. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Kasaasikitono biitiwa; aane bukfa; aane kar'fa; meebaason zuutifana botoba aafa; sinuntano Ha'otu maasifar. Nitto kasaastan akamanon denalowa! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Nittoossin rakkatere neebaasta isa wona daysuk chimnir oonso? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Es kasho chowaason zaguk chimnoytir sinnanneen oomaasik awuniron tiir'o nittotin ephfaso? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Fur'aas aakkak kayira dichfanamato biitiwa; aane hopifa; aane sukfa; sinuntano Solomonnu fa ulfintobaasik fur'aassin isaasne faaronnu aane mayewa. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Ha'oos hawung biistefaat wono geyaassi ha'toni kuwaason ekka maysinanneen amantonti yo'ina nittotin aakkane faaron arkissira maysuni!<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>«Es bari boor'a nitto: ‹Awu muunirinso? wedey awu ushanirinso?› yit rakkatotiitawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Es baron han daastaki fe asuni meya zuuttere sholeseter. Sinuntano samak fe Abantiis es bar zuuttambaase nittok sholsifanamato arir. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Es baron zagustan zeemma Ha'oosi taatono sholoti. Sholsuus zuuttera nittok imtona.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Han Daasta Otumni Zuutu Aane Sholsifa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat. 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>«Abantiis taatobaason nittok imanak ma'a safaraba sinna boor'a nitto garo wodo digotiita. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Nittoki fayiison kisira waagera tukamiisik imti. Wiis tai'sonoyna dimta, konymar muunoyna dimta, kur'unoy ha'matosi, ko'unoy otma den sama keer zuututi. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Waagnitiis faanaasta nibnitiis dey esta foona.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Guzu Wostinynya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Kawunanon teebera wostok hooroti. Tonnitiis dey chaaron. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Daambesiis sargini keerun wolunanneen oodfe wostinynyane feer sinti. Baasso dey daambesiis yeere gamalaason ki'fena kabaasik geregere gachak hoore fe asuni meyane feeseterwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Daambesiis yeefena kabaasik guzire oodde fe wostinynyani meya suustowa. Futok makefawungwa, daambesiis kawunanon teebere baassotin maddiisi biratota duusuna dey irbasunawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Daambesiis wassi wedey wassineen orfo yeere kar'fena kabaasik guzire oodde feeseten danfena wostinynyani meya suustowa. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Han baron dey arutiwa, wiis aage yoonamato keeni abaas ari sinfaanane keebaason yiishshe girifena kabaasik shaakkire biyana kabatawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Asuni Naa dey safaronoyti wonaktu yoona sinna boor'a nitto dey hoorera oodtiwa.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma'a Wostinynyanawa Mangu Wostinynyana Asi Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat. 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Phexiros dey: «Daamiiso, han makefata besos inno innokingwa wedey oomisikneenninso?» yit mamsi.<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Daamiis wolgire: «Ese keerki asu zuuttambesiise asik muubesiison sholsifana kabaastak imanaknawa ha'sunakna daamiis taassina nibbarere amanamto wostinynya oonso? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Daambaas wolle yeere es maktenaasimato zagifeen danna wostinynyaas suustowa. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa, daambaas fa wuzba zuuttambaase asiistatu taassunawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Sinuntano es wostinynyaas: ‹Daamtaas tai'ni aafa yoonawuza, woknir› yit ushet, zayet arqa wostinynyaasinnawa mashka wostinynyaasonna icha ephfe. <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Es wostinynyaasa daam bar safaronoyna wontanawa oodnoyna sa'atitana yoona. Kace kacere ixabaason dey amanonoy baassoneen zaguna.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>«Daambaasa safaranon arifegedo hooronoy wedey daambaas sholefena wuzason zagunoy wostinynyaas mangu ke'otu ephphetoona. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Sinuntano daambaasa safaranon arunoy ke'ota katuni mangsu zagi bar garo ke'otu ephphetoona. Showo wuza imtena barkin showo wuzatu sholtefar. Akama adara imtena barkin akamatu oodtefar.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Oor Oor Kisuktu Ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Ta han daasta geyatu ephpha yaanwa. Hash saami sinfaanane aakka girona kabanso! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Sinuntano ta haphuktona shanani haphukto faarwa. Hamma ko'una kabaneen beysana aafawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Ta han daasta naga ephpha yaanarne faar sinna nittok bestefawoso? indaanewa, ta ephpha yaanay oor oor kisutano nagatawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Hash hawungneen kabira isa keyaassi feese uuch asuni meya oor oor kesonerwa. Keeziis heppiisata, heppiis keeziisata kabire wol faassosonewa. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Abaas naasata, Naas abaasata, Intoos nawaasta, Nawaas intoosta, Intoos naasa asuta, Naasa asu naasa intota kabsere wol faassere oor oor kesonewa.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wonaason Aru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat. 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Dey Yesus daraasik ekka yi: «Shaaru awgirun kesin biifeti kabaasik geregere: ‹Hash hawung iro ichnirwa› yifeti. Es bar dey sinfa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Siru kawudan kabira sirifana kabaasik: ‹hash hawung noi'sunirwa› yifeti. Es bar dey sinfa. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Sinnoy sinne bestefe nitto daasewa samaase asi gitonon biyak sinni baron aritirwa. Eekan han fa neyaasta sinni baron biire aru aakkak hopitiso? <verse eid="LUK 12:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>Nitto teetnitiisik biira futoni mangsuni kar'a awagan kar'a beytiso? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Gumane es neen malaten gaanynyani sina ta'atak hamfata kabaasik zeemma uguntak faagedo ganok duudowa. Eeku shakaatane neen zatte gaanynyaaski taamarwa. Gaanynyaas dey aatire meya taar'osik imana. Meya taar'oos dey taatoni keer gedana. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Neek makefawungwa, koi'ni duudeeson kaasunoy es taatoni keyaassin aafawa kesata wuza.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Harmunoy Bar Tishir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Es kabaasik asuni meya Yesusniki yeesere: «Galiilaki asuni meya maa'a imefeen Pilatos wori; Harinbesiison dey maa'aasneen ane woi'si» yit maksete. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Eekin es Galiilaki asuni meya oom Galiilaki asusatan denalo boor'besi faanar sinne nittok bestefewoso? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Indaanewa, nitto dey boor'nitiison harmu shakaatine esiisimatotu tishutiwa yifawungwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Selehomki shu'ni keyaas shakira ichcha worina asire nangne asuni meeni chowaason awu safarefetiso? Baasso Yerusalemki fe asuni meya zuuttambesiise asiisatan denalo boor'ne feer sinne nittok bestefewoso? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Indaanewa; nitto dey boor'nitiison harmu shakaatine zuuttamnitiise esiisimatotu tishutiwa yifawungwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gaannoy Belesiisi Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Yesus ekka yit han besoson make: «Isa asu wayinini foshbaasta isa belesi yiste i'oba faar. Es belesiissin gaana kephanak hamme isanne aane dane. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Wayinini foshaasi wostinynyanik: ‹Esenu gaana kephanak keez wogga han belesiiski yaara isanne aane danutwa. Es bari boor'a kar'a ha'uwa, awuniron baak daason mangsidifarinso?› yi. <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Wostinynyaas wolgire: ‹Daamiiso, biratobaason yiishsha futu ha'ira biyanak hanetiison beywa. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Wonne gaanfaanane ma'arwa, gaana shakaanane kar'a ha'utawa› » yi.<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Beysani Wonak Geshoba Kuupa Mashkasu Fari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Yesus isa beysani wonak Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi assit feer. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Estak asire nangne wogga kiina ayyana geshobaason kuupsina isa mashkasu faar. Bar dey kaanne kutuk aane chimfa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesus baron biire barki teegefaat: «Ne han asuse meroneessin faritwe» yi. <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Kushubaasik ta'in geregere kaanna yere. Ha'ooson dey galatte. <verse eid="LUK 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Sinuntano Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi gaanynya Yesus beysani wonaasik fatubaasik gi'tere daraasik: «Issun wostoni wona faarwa. Es wostoni wonaasikitosi yaara farutitano beysani wonaasiktawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Daamiis wolgire: «Sinnoy sinne bestefe nitto, nitto ganeyaassin beysani wonaasik gachubaason wedey hanyabaason tuptenaastan kotte akani uhshusi ephphe hamnor oonso? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Han mashkasus Abrahamni zala sinna faagedo asire nangne wogga kiina ayyanak taatera faar. Eekin beysani wonaasik han asuson taatoossin kottonak aane sholsifanoso?» yi. <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Ekka makobaasik barin oomtefe baassotin zuutire iichshi. Sinuntano daraas bar wostena diinqi wostoosik zuuttere giresete.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fi'fi'oni Gaanni Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat. 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar. 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Estan Yesus ekka yi: «Ha'oosi taato awune faarinso? Awuneen hoossira nittok makonarinso? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Isa asu ephphe taamme buloossi bukna fi'fi'oni gaanane faarwa. Bar dey kayira dichcha i'o sini. Kasaas dey waa'baassi keeba keer'a di.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Hepsa dey Yesus ekka yi: «Ha'oosi taatonon awuneen hoossunarinso? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Isa mashkasu tusho kesanak woi'sina masone faarwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tugo Finynya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat. 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Esseen orfo Yesus Yerusalem hamfena kabaasik katama katamaassinawa ke'e ke'eessina fe asusin assit aatet feer. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Isa asu yeere: «Daamiiso, faruniis garo asu koi'banoso?» yi. Yesus dey ekka yire wolgi: <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>«Tugo finynyiissi giruk kabotiwa. Nittok makefawungwa, showobesiis giruk sholseter, sinuntano giruk aafa chimosone wuza. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Keyaasi aba kabire gamalaason kulfinanneen orfo nitto gero yerefaat: ‹Daamiiso gachaywa› iyaafa gamalaason ki'ati. Bar dey: ‹Nitto oo sintimatonawa ayin yaasetimatona aane arifatwa› yire wolguna. <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Nitto dey: ‹Neneen ane maara ushniwa, zuuttoni dimaastak dey innotin assitwa› uti. <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Bar dey hepsa wolgire: ‹Nitto oo sintimatonawa ayin yaasetimatona aane arifatwa. Mangu wuza zagife nitto tayistan woktiwa› una.<verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>«Abrahamnin, Yisaqnin Yaqobninnawa raajjuni meyanonna zuutira Ha'oosi taatosi feeseten biyatiwa. Sinuntano nitto ek gero ha'tera waasnewa ha'ni koyne nittok sinana. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Asuni meya awa kesnarkinnawa awa girinarkinna, yeeshdaannawa kawudaanna yeesere Ha'oosi taatoni kootanon muusonek tai'sosone. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Ese dey zeema baasso orfo wolser sinone; orfo wolse baasso dey zeemar sinone» yi.<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Yerusalemni Boor'a Waasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Es kabaasik Ferisawini meyaassin isa isar yeesere: «Herodis neen worunak sholediferwa kabira hantan hamma» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Bar wolgire: «Hamfaat es bowasik: ‹Esenu hawungnawa wonona kiina ayyanaason asusasin kisunar, mettanni meyanon fatunar, keessinari wono dey wostonaason koi'sunar› yiwa utiwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Raajjuus Yerusalemni gerakalo kitunak aane sholsifawa. Es bari boor'a hawungneen wononeen yoononeen ek Yerusalem hamanarwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>Yerusalem Yerusalemne! Raajjuni meyanon worifa ne! Neeki wostere yeese baassotin shu'ak keri ne! Ako nawubaason kosobaasi sikalosi zuutira geepefanaasimato naanggotneeson zuutuk apuna wolla sholen. Sinuntano neneen daraneesneen taan beyeti. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Esenu keentiis ona sinnatu fui'tona. Nittok makefawungwa: ‹Daamiisa sunak yeefe bar suustowa› utinneen hawungneen ekalo taan aafa biyati wuza» yi.<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Hepsa Beysani Wonaasik Isa Mettannin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Isa beysani wonak Ferisawini meeni gaanynyaasasin isaaski Yesus muu muunak giri. Ferisawini meya bar zaguna wuzason biyonek oodet feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Estak dey isa atuba wolsina mettan asu feer. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesus Museni tumaasi aruni meyanonnawa Ferisawini meyanonna: «Tumaas beysani wonaasik mettaniisin fatu kalfawa wedey aane kalfanso?» yit mamsi.<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Sinuntano baasso shaakisete. Yesus asusin ta'ire fatire gafki. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Dey Yesus: «Nittoossin isa asu nawuba wedey gachuba beysani wonak gawu girifaanane eelle kisunor oonso?» yi. <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Baasso dey isa wuzane wolguk aane chimoto.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yesus koota muusonek teegte asuni meya ulfinni dimta duuk kabsefeen biyaat han besoson make: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>«Isa asu sargi kootere teegefaanane ulfinni dimta duutatawa. Awuzakne neyistan ulfinto asu teegtere feer sinanak chimana. <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Hepontiise asin teege asus yeere: ‹Han kodaason barik imma› iyaanane ne iichchet kerera daakalo duutawa.<verse eid="LUK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>«Sinuntano teegtera hamfata kabaasik daakaloki dimaasta duwa. Neen teege bar yeere: ‹Zomotaaso kabira denaloki ulfinto dimaasta duwa› una. Ne dey es kabaasik neneen ane teegte baasso sina ulfina danatawa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Esiis dey teetbaason den teggunak sholefe bar daa hatona. Teetbaason daa hatessife bar den teguna.» <verse eid="LUK 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Yesus kootaason hoossi asusik dey: «Meshmeta wedey meeta'uni kootera hoossifata kabaasik koobaason wolgire kaasuk kootere teegoni zomoneesakitonin, ayneesa kitonin, koonneesakitonin wedey otum wolkonesakitonin tegotaatawa. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Sinuntano koota hoossifa ta kabaasik tukamiisin, engitiisin, laafaasinnawa aaftishusinna teegowa. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Baasso dey kowa kaasuk aafa chimone wuza sinna boor'a ne dey suustowa. Ookoni meya kitun kabsefe wono koobaason Ha'oos neek kaasunawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akama Kootaasi Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat. 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Yesusneen muuni muuk diise baassossin isaas es baron odaat: «Ha'oosi taatoni kootanon muuk duuni bar aakka suustonso!» yi. <verse eid="LUK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesus dey: «Isa asu akama meeta'uni koota hoossire showo asunin teege. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Es Kootaas maastona sa'atiis kar'fana kabaasik kootaason hoossi bar: ‹Ese zuuttambaase hoorena boor'a yootiwa› yire teegonak wostinynyabaasin wosi. <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Sinuntano zuuttambesiise kootaaski yoo beyonek chowa sholsete. Isaas: ‹Daa waagena boor'a hamma biyanak sholsuwa. Taak fakiya zaguwa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Oomiis dey: ‹Uuch kamada gachwa waagen sinna boor'a kamadera biyanarwa. Taak fakiya zaguwa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Oomiis dey: ‹Asu ephpha mari sinna boor'a yoonak aafa chimanawuza› yi.<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>«Wostinynyabaas wolle yeere es baron daambaasik make. Es kabaasik keyaasi daam gi'tere wostinynyabaasin: ‹Tai'nin ek katamaasi ari uguntannawa garo garo shaatoostanna kesfaat tukamiisin, laafaasin, aaftishusin engitfe baassotin hang teegera yowa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Wostinynyaas wolle yeere: ‹Daamiiso, maketa baron zuutira zaginwa. Sinuntano hashnu duustoni dima faarwa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Es bari boor'a daambaas wostinynyaasin: ‹Keenaas tuumananneen ek katamaasi gerakalo fa ari ugnaastanawa shaatoostana kesfaat danta asus zuuttere yeere girsonek zaguwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Nittok makefawungwa, han teegtere beya asuni meyaassin isa asunu ta kootaason aafawa muusone wuza› » yi.<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nawo Sina Kaassifana Waaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat. 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Showo dara Yesusni orfoose hamefeen yerqere baassok: <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>«Taaki yoonak shole bar zuuttere ababaasin, intobaason, asubaason, naanggotbaason, aybaasakitonin, eetbaasikitonon, kaabaason gedde oomto shakaanane ta nawo sinanak aafa chimanawuza. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Basa mesqeliison wor'e ta orfoose yoonoy bar nawota sinanak aafa chima wuza.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>«Nittoossin isar shu'ni keya keer'anak sholefaanane es keyaason keer'e kisunak hooroni waaga foobaason zeemme diire awune fa waaga koi'sunamato safaronoy asu oonso? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Es baro zagu shakaat kaptaason yiishshe keer'e koi'su hopifaanane es keyaason biya asu zuuttere barin kanyarwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>‹Han asus keer'anak kabina keyaason keer'e koi'suk aane chimewa› yittu kanyosone. <verse eid="LUK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Asir kum meya taar'oba feena isa taato hepasir kum meya taar'oba feena oom taatoosneen etere merok sholefaanane gumabaasin merobaasewa mero beybaase zeemme diire merkonor oonso? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Neebere wolguk hopunir sinfaanane es oom taatoos wokak feen kur'uni wosire ganok mamsifewa. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Esiisimato nittoossin fa wuzbaason zuutire taakwa yaat beynoy oonu sinfaanane nawota sinanak aafa chimanawuza.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>«Kawoos ma'arwa; Sinuntano kaar'baason turkifaanane aakkak kaar'ak chimnirinso? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Es effatena kawoos daasik taa'o aafa sinanawuza sinna boor'a ek gero kisiretu ha'sonewa. Odoni odoba feena bar odowowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Tishira Beste Fantuni Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat. 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Girbo zuutife baassotnawa boor'ni meena odok zuuttesere Yesusniki yeesete. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Ferisawini meenewa Museni tumaasi assinynyana: «Han asus boor'ni meyanon barki tai'sir. Baassoneen ane dey meer» yit Yesusniista unyisete. <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Es bari boor'a Yesus han besoson ekka yit baassok make:<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>«Nitto ganeyaassin tiya fantuba faana isa asu, es fantubaassin isar tishfaanane izginasire izgineeson feesh dimaasta ha'aat tishi baron danananneen sholok hamnor oonso? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Danfena kabaasik girere ogogbaasta wor'e keeba yeefewa. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Hamme keeba kar'fena kabaasik zomobaasakitoninnawa wolkobaasakitoninna isarik teegere: ‹Tishi fantunaason danna boor'a taneen ane girotiwa› una. <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Nittok makefawungwa, esiisimato dey harmiya sholsunoyna izginasire izgine ookoni meyaastan denalo harmire wolife isa boor' asusik den samak akama gira sinfawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tishira Beste Duudeni Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «birrikin wosuste asir saantibiba faana isa mashkasu asiriissin isaas tishfaanane danananneen tona tonira keebaason futira sholonoy asu oonso? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Danfana kabaasik zomobaasikitononnawa wolkobaasikitononna isarik teegera: ‹Tishi birrini saantibinaason danna boor'a taneen ane giroti› una. <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Nittok makefawungwa, harmi isa boor' asusik Ha'oosi wosini sinak esiisimato dey gira sinfawa.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tishire Beste Naani Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Tusire dey Yesus: «Hep naanggotba feena isa asu feer. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Hate naas ababaasin: ‹Abataaso otumneessin taak kar'ni baron haa'a imma› yi. Abaas dey otumbaason hep naanggotiisik haa'i. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Hate naas garo wonaneen orfo waagbaason ephphe woka dima hami. Es hamna dimaastak sholenamato sikere waagbaason tishki. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Fayiison zuutire koi'sinanneen orfo es daasta akama maka giri. Barin dey rakko ephi. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Es bari boor'a es daastak isa asuniki teete. Es asus dey muko keemanak zagi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Naas dey mukoosi muunon muunak sholet feer. Sinuntano es baronnu barik ima asu aafe.<verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>«Estan naas nibbaassi ekka yit safare: ‹Abataasa keerki wostinynyaas apuninso muu gawire fu'eferi? Sinuntano ta hantak makak kitunarwa! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Kabira abataaski hamfaat Abataaso; Ha'oosewa neena asi sina mangsingwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Hanneen ekalo ne naa sinna teegtonak aane sholsifawa. Sinuntano wostinynyanesasin isaasne feer zagira ephphatowa› unawa. <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Estan kabi ababaaski hami. Ababaas dey woksok yeefeen biire kenashte. Ek barki eelle idimme daame. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Naas: ‹Abataaso, Ha'oosewa neena asi sina mangsingwa. Hawungneen ekalo ne naa sinna teegtonak aane sholsifawa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Sinuntano ababaas wostinynyabaasakitonik ekka yi: ‹Tai'nin oomaastan denalo gada maama teshshera maysutiwa. Kushubaassi dey gila yeetira, wochobaassi chaa'ma yetutiwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Faru zibiicchaason teshshera shukti. Muuni, dey gironi. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Han naataas kitire feer. Hash dey kaak feer. Tishire feer. Hash dey beste› yi. Baasso dey girok kabsete.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>«Es kabaasik arki naas buloni foshtatu fe. Yeere ke'e tai'sefena kabaasik surunewa ililchune asi kaama ode. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Wostinynyaasasin isarin teegere: ‹Han odefana wuzaas aambanso?› yit mamsi. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Wostinynyaas wolgire: ‹Aynees wolle yeena boor'awa. Abanees dey faru zibiiccha barik shuktewa› yi.<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>«Arki aybaas gi'tere keer girunak aane sholowe. Ababaas keerun kesse keer girunak shiiphe. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Arki naas wolgire ababaasik: ‹Effatena showo neya neek wosten. Maketaason isanne aane bewut. Zomotaasneen ane maara gironak isa garo nor'oninne aane imewa. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Sinuntano han Naanees otumneeson gerkesa asuneen sikere tishkaat yeen faru zibichcha barik shukit› yi. <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Ababaas dey: ‹Naataaso, ne wonna wonna taneen anetu faatwa. Taar sina bar zuuttera neerwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Sinuntano han aynees kitire feer. Hash kaak feer. Tishire feyiis hash dey beste. Es bari boor'a gironik sholsifawa› » yi.<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Amanamtonoy Wostinynya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesus nawobaasakitonik: «Isa otum asu otumbaason ha'sife isa wostinynyaba feer. Asuni meya otum asusik: ‹Han otumneeson ha'sife bar otumneeson siket feerwa› yit maksete. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Es otum asus otumbaason ha'sife barin teegere: ‹Han odefana ne chowaas aambanso? Hanneen ekalo ta otumnaason ha'sutak aafa chimata wuza sinna boor'a kushuneessi fa otumnaasi faadani tichanon taak imma› yi. <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Otumbaason ha'sife bar dey nibbaassi: ‹Daamtaas han wostoossin taan kalle kisunir sinna boor'a awu zagunarinso? Bulonak hugnana aafa. Shiiphonak iichchonar. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Awu zagunamato aringwa. Daamtaas wostoossin taan kisaanane keebesiissi taan ephonek zomoni hoossunawa› yi.<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>«Estan daambaasa kowa baassosta faana asuni meyanon isa isarbesiisin teegere. Tesuni asusin: ‹Daamtaasa kowa apuninso neyista faari?› yi. <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Bar dey: ‹Isa tiya waasha zayitini kowatu faarwa› yi. Otumbaason ha'sife bar: ‹Effar foobaason besifa tichaasi wuli esewa; diifaat uuchasir waasha zayitini kowa faar yira tichuwa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Estan oomiisin: ‹Neyista fa kowa apuninso?› yi. Bar dey: ‹Tiya kumtali zagoni kowa faarwa› yi. Otumbaason ha'sife bar: ‹Effar sinbaason besifa wulini tichaas esewa; nangnasir kumtali yira tichuwa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Daambaas amanamtoba foonto wostinynyaasin haxxumabaasi techmanon diinqe. Ha'oni asusatan denalo han daastaki asuni meya han daastaki foobesiisik haxxe sinobesiisontu besifa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Waagaason Sholsu Dimta Feeshu Sholsifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>«Nittok makefawungwa, han daastaki waagaas koi'fana kabaasik sama keeruk nittotin ephonek han waagaasik zomontirin hoossutiwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Garo wuzaasik amanamtoos inya wuzaasik amanamto sinana. Garo wuzaasik amanamtonoy bar inya wuzaasik aafawa amanamtona wuza. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Ese han daastaki waagaasik amanamto beyfaatine futoni waagaason oonso amanere nittok imniri? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Oom asusa waagaasik amanamto sina shakaatine nitto teetni waagaason oonso nittok imniri?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>«Isa asu hep daamnik boz sinanak aafewa chimanawuza. Isaasin oomtefaat hepsaasin shunana. Isaasin ulfinsuna hepsaasi kashshuna. Ha'oosiknawa waaga asikna boz sinak aafa chimati wuza.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Ferisawini meya waaga shuneter sinna boor'a es baron odaat Yesusnin kanyesete. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Yesus dey: «Nitto teetnitiison asuni sina ooko zagifetiwa. Sinuntano Ha'oos nibnitiisi safaranon arirwa. Asuni sinak ulfintoos Ha'oosi sinak oomtesterwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Museni Tumaasewa Ephne Girune</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat. 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>Tusire dey Yesus: «Tumaasewa raajjuni meeni tichaase Yohannisniista kar'ananneen maktet faar. Esseen hang dey Ha'oosi taatoni misirachchuni kaamaas maktedifar. Asu zuuttere dey es Ha'oosi taatosi girunak kabedifewa. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Sinuntano tumaassin isa duktone yo'ubaastan samaasewa daase aatfaanane kashowa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>«Asubaason gafkaat ooma asu ephfe bar zuuttere gerkesowa. Esiisimato dey teegobaaskin gafukte asuson epha bar gerkesowa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Otum Asusnawa Tukam Alazarna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>Dey Yesus ekka yi: «waagba chima She'a maamnewa sesa maamne mayo isa otum asu feer. Bar dey wonna akama ge'aktu feefe. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Atuba zuuttera mazayena Alazar yiste tukam otum asusa finynyita kunfer. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Es tukam asus otum asusa madditan zigifa fufuntooson muunak sholet feer. Kanaasikito dey yaataafa mazabaason naarit faar.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>«Es tukamiis dey kiti. Ha'oosi wosiyanikito dey Abrahamni tesha ephpha taami. Otum asus dey kitire kabbarte. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Ke'oni dimaassi feefaat kaanne woksok Abrahamninnawa basa tesha fe Alazarninna bi. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Es otum asus: ‹Aba Abrahamno, taak kenashtowa. Han geyaasi winosi yerenar sinna boor'a kushubaasi sanak aka dukire terumnaason haatunak Alazarnin taaki wosuwa› yit chaagi.<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>«Abraham wolgire ekka yi: ‹Naataaso, ne daastaki fooneesi neyak ma'a wuza dantamato safarowa. Sinuntano Alazar dey daastak mangu wuza ephpheteena boor'a hash bar hanta ma'arik foona ne dey shanasi foota. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Es baristan denalo nittonawa innona asi ganeyaassi inya gawu faarwa. Es bari boor'a innokin nittoki dey nittokin innoki finak chimnir oonu aafewa.› <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Otum asus dey ekka yi: ‹Ese Aba Abrahamno, Alazarnin abataasa keer wosutak shiiphefawungwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Uuch ayta feeseter sinna boor'a baasso dey han shanani dimaassi yoosonoytemato hamme makowowa.›<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>«Sinuntano Abraham: ‹Baassok Musenawa raajjuni meena feeseterwa. Baassokin odosotowa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Otum asus dey: ‹Ekkatawa aba Abrahamno, isa asu kitun kabire hamme makefaanane harmusobesiwa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Abraham dey: ‹Museni tichaasonnawa raajjuni meeni matsafaasonna odo beya baasso isa asu kitun kabire hamme makefenaknu aafawa odosone wuza.› »<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Asunik Tuusa Sinaastan Teetni Ooda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat. 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mar. 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesus nawobaasakitonik ekka yi: «Asuni meyanon tuusa'sira boor'a wostosonek zaguniwuza yoo beyana wuza aafawa. Sinuntano es boor'aassi tuusanon ephphe yooni asus yerefawowa. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Oonu han garo garo naanggotaassin isaason tuusa'subaastan inya wooni shu'a suutbaasta taatera tir'maassi ha'tefaanane ma'arwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Es bari boor'a nitto teetaasik arutiwa. Ayne neen miir'efaanane ke'uwa. Es mangsubaasik gaabbefaanane feeshun uwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Wonaassin naafuna wolle neen miir'efaananenawa neeki wolle yeefaafe: ‹Mangsunaasik gaabbengwa› iyaanane feeshun uwa.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Wosibaasakito dey Daamiisin: «Amantoniison innok daysaywa?» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Daamiis dey wolgire: «fi'fi'oni gaanane fa garo amantonti faafaanane han di teyaason: ‹Waatera yeet tir'maassi toktowe› yifaatine nittok ajajamtonawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hoorere Yere Wostinynya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Nitto ganeyaassin isaas bulinynyaba wedey fantuni keemerba feenar es wostinynyaas wostobaassin wolle yeefena kabaasik geregere: ‹Hang tai'sera diira muuneeson muwa› yifewoso? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Es baristan zeemme: ‹Meeta'u taak hoossuwa. Ta maara ushananneen taar'era taak wostowa. Esseen orfo ne dey maara ushata› utanoso yifenari? <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Eekin es wostinynyabaas daambaas makena baron ma'i yire wostobaasik daambaas galattefewoso? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Ese nitto dey makte baron zuutira zagifeti kabaasik: ‹Inno ke'noy wostinynyawa; Zagunik sholsi wostoosontu wosteniwa› utiwa.»<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asir Awataatoni Mettan Fari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yesus Yerusalem hamaas Samariyanewa Galiilane asi ganesi kamo aati. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Isa ke'esi kar'fena kabaasik asir awataatoni meroni mettanni meya barin huphsere woksok yeesesefaat: <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>«Yesus Daamniiso, innok kenashtefaywa!» yiset tega kaamak maksete.<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Yesus baassotin biyaat: «Hamefaat atuntiison maagni meyak besutiwa» yi. Baasso dey hamefegedo ugnaastak farsete. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Baasso ganeyaassin isaas farubaason biinaase akama kaamak chaagge Ha'ooson galattet wolle ye. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Yesusni wochoossi kaa'nere galatte. Bar dey Samariyaki asu. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yesus ekka yi: «Awataatoni merobesiissin fariis asir asutenoso? Eekin izginiis ayfeeseteso? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Han alaga asusteno oom Ha'ooson galattok wolle yeer aafenoso?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Yesus es asusin: «Kabira hamma; amantonees neen fatiwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ha'oosi Taatoni Yoo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat. 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Ferisawini meya Yesusnin: «Ha'oosi taato aagenso yoonari?» yire mamussete. Bar dey ekka yire wolgi: «Ha'oosi taato asuni meya biisefeesne fa ugnak aafawa yoonawuza. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Hantawa wedey ek estawa uuk aafa chimone wuza. Ha'oosi taato han nitto ganeyaassitu fawa.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Tusire Yesus nawobaasakitonik ekka yi: «Asusa Naani wonaasikitosi isaason biyak kaltoti wona yoona. Sinuntano aafa biyati wuza. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Asuni meya: ‹Kiristoos hantatu fewa wedey ek estatu fewa› yire nittok maksone. Baasso orfone hamatiita dey zoonustotiita. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Kawuna samaasta kawunna dilaneen dila katira chaarsifanaasimato Asuni Naa yeefena wono esiisimatotu sinana. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Sinuntano es bar sinbaasneen zeemma Asuni Naa akama shana ephphetoonaknawa han koontoosik dey kashistonakna sholsuwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Noohni neyaasik sinnaasimato Asuni Naa yeefena wono dey ekkatu sinana. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Nooh merkebiissi giruna wona kar'ananneen asuni meya meetnawa ushetna; ephetnawa giritna feeseter. Tishkuni akaas yaara zuuttambesiise asin tishki. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Looxni neyaasik dey esiisimatotu sini. Asuni meya meetnawa ushetna; keerun kisire waagetnawa geron waagere yeetna; toko toketnawa keya keer'etna feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Sinuntano Loox Sodomun kesna wono saman geenewa geeni kayone woottera zuuttambesiise asin tishki. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Asuni Naa wolle yoona wono ekkatu sinana.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>«Es wono keyaasi tukta fe bar oonu sinfaanane keer fa wuzbaason ephanak keronaata. Buloni dimaasta fe asus keer wolunaata. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Looxni asus sinna baron safaroti. <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Kaabaason fu'ok shole bar zuuttambaase tishkuna. Sinuntano kaabaason aatire ima bar fu'ona. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Nittok makefawungwa; es wonoti waalaasik hep asu isa kuphota kunona; isaas oottona; isaas fui'tona. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Hep mashkasu isa dimta meya ni'ona; isaas oottona; Hepsaas fui'tona. [<verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Hep asu buloni dimaasta wostosone; isaas oottona; hepsaas fui'tona»]<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Nawoni meya dey: «Daamiiso; oottere hamonees ayinso?» yit mamussete. Yesus dey: «Asha faanaastatu arikasa zuuttefawa» yit wolgi.<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Tukama Dicha Asunewa Mangu Gaanynyaasna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Yesus nawobaasakitonik hopunoy wonna wonna shiiphsonek sholsu sinnamato besuk han besoson ekka yit make: <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>«Isa katamaasi Ha'ooson digonor asunin dey iichchonoy isa gaanynya feer. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Es katamaassi isa dicha asu faar. Bar dey gaanynyaaski hamfaafa: ‹Taanawa ta gumaasna asi ganesi fa malataasik mangsu kar'wa› iyaafa shimsi. <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4-5"/>Gaanynyaas dey es kabaasik ma'i aane uwe. Sinuntano orfo nibbaassi ekka yi: ‹Ha'ooson digo beyfanak wedey asunin iichcho beyfanak han dicha asus taan shimsit faar sinna boor'a wonna wonna taan rakkisunoynamato barik mangsu kar'anawa› » <verse eid="LUK 18:4-5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Tusire dey Daamiis: «Mangu gaanynyaas makena baro yaadatoti. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Eekin toone waalinne Ha'ooski chaaget feese bari korto asusin aafanoso baassok mangsu kar'anawuza? Baassotin argasunoy wokniroso? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Nittok makefawungwa; tapteratu mangsu kar'anawa. Sinuntano Asuni Naa wolle han daasta yeefena kabaasik amantoba faana asunin danungeso?» yi.<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Beqeto Ferisawinawa Garam Girboni Zuutibona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Tusire Yesus teetbesiison ooko zagire teetoknawa oomiisin dey kashshisefe baassokna han besoson make: <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>«Hep asuni meya shiiphok betemeqdesi hamete. Isaas Ferisawi; hepsaas girbo zuuti asu.<verse eid="LUK 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>«Ferisawiis yerefaat nibbaassi ekka yit shiiphe: ‹Ha'oose; ta oom asuni meenimato bo'inynya, mangu, gerkesar sina beyna boor'a neen galattefan. Han baristan denalo han girbo zuutife boor'inynya asusne feer sina beyna boor'a neen galattefan. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Ta torbaniissin hep wona soomenar. Danfanaastan asiriissin isaron imnar› yi.<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>«Sinuntano girbo zuutife asus woksok yerefaat den sama kaanne biyanaknu aane chime. Nibbaason ki'et: ‹Ha'oose; ta boor'inynyaasin fakuwe› yit shiiphe. <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Nittok makefawungwa; Ferisawisatan denalo Ha'oosi sina ooko sinne faattere keeba hami. Teetbaason den teggife bar daa hatona. Sinuntano teetbaason daa hatessife bar den teguna.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Garo Garo Naanggotaason Suusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar. 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Yesus garo garo naanggotaason suusanak barki teshshesete. Nawobaasakito dey es baron biyaat kalesete. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Sinuntano Yesus garo garo naanggotaason barki teegere ekka yi: «Garo garo naanggota taaki yoonoynamato kalatiita. Ha'oosi taato han barikitone feyisikwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Nittok futo makefawungwa; Ha'oosi taatonon han garo garo naanggotaasne faaron zagire ephphetoonoy bar aafawa giruna wuza.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Han Daastaki Omaasewa Samaki Taatoose</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat. 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar. 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Ayhudni gaanynye meyaassin isaas: «Garam assinynyano, koi'ba foonto kaak danak awu zagunarinso?» yit mamsi.<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesus ekka yire wolgi: «Awuniron taan garam yifasso? Isa Ha'oosneen oom garam oonu aafewa. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>‹Gerkesataata; kaa worutaata, wiisotaata, esha zaala makotaata, abanesinnawa intoneesonna ulfinsu› yifa ajajiison aritarwa.»<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Asus dey: «Es ajajiisikitonon daagnaseneen ooddatu fawungwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesus es baron odenaase: «Ese isa wuza zaguta wuzatu fu'terwa, fa wuzneeson zuutira waagera tukamni meyak imma. Sama keeruk danatawa. Eekan taneen ane hamniwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Sinuntano asus akama otumba faar sinna boor'a es baron odenaase akamanon suume. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesus asusi akamanon suumenamato biyaat ekka yi: «Akama otumbesi faana baassok Ha'oosi taatosi giru awune fa tiir'onso? <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Otum asu Ha'oosi taatosi girubaastan gaala marufni aafsi kamo aatbaastu kashowa.»<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Es baron ode asuni meya: «Eekin oonso faruk chimniri?» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Sinuntano Yesus wolgire: «Asunik chimtonoy wuzaas Ha'oosik chimterwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Phexiros: «Ese inno fa wuzniison zuutira beyya neneen ane yaaniwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29-30"/>Yesus wolgire: «Futo nittok makefawungwa, Ha'oosi taatokwa iyaat keebaason wedey asubaason wedey aybaasakitonin wedey kooni aba intooson wedey naanggotbaason beya bar han daastak hep kushunon, yooni neyaasik koi'ba foonto kaa ephphetoonor oonu aafewa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 18:29-30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kitunir Sinbaasonnawa Kitun Kabunir Sinbaasonna Keezsa Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar. 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesus asire heppe nawobaasakitonin oor kisaat baassok ekka yi: «Ese ek Yerusalem hamanirwa. Asuni Naani chowaasik raajjuni meyaki kamo tichche bar ko'unirwa <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Bar Aazabni meyak aattere imtonir. Baasso dey barin kashshusone, me'osone, tujosone. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Ichosone, estan worsone. Sinuntano bar keessinari wono kitun kabuna.»<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Sinuntano nawobaasakitonik es makena chowaas zuuttera aane galowa. Bar makena chowaas baassok aachena boor'a awu makenamato aane arsoto.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Isa Aaftishunin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat. 20:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Yesus Iyyariko tai'sefena kabaasik isa aaftishu ugunta diifaat shiiphedifer. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Aaftishuus teshba kamo aatfe daraasa kaamanon odefaat: «Han bar aambanso?» yire mamsi.<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Baasso dey: «Naaziretki Yesustu hanta kamo aattiferwa» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Aaftishuus dey: «Dawitni naa Yesusno, taan fakifaywa» yit chaagi. <verse eid="LUK 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Sinaasta hamet fe asuni meya: «Shaakkuwa!» yit kalete. Sinuntano bar kaambaason teggire: «Dawitni naaso taan fakifaywa» yit chaagi.<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Estan Yesus yerere asusin: «Hang taaki yowa» yit ajaje. Aaftishuus barki tai'sefena kabaasik: <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>«Neek awu zagunakinso sholefatari?» yire mamsi. Aaftishuus: «Daamiiso, biyanaktu sholefaungwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesus dey: «Biwa, amantonees neen fatiwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Aaftishuus geregere bi. Ha'ooson dey galattet Yesusneen ane hami. Daraas zuuttere es baron biyeteese Ha'ooson galattesete.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Zekkiwoosna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yesus Iyyarikoni katamaassi kamo aatte hamdifer. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Estak Zakkiwoos yiste girbo zuutife baasso gaanynya sina otum asu feer. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Bar Yesus aaffer sinnamato biyanak sholet feer. Sinuntano yer'ba kawuna sinna boor'a daraasa showotan kabi chowa biyak aane chime. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Yesus aatte hamana ugnaasta barin biyak sina eelle isa teeni i'ota kesi. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yesus esta kar'fena kabaasik den kaanne biyaat: «Zakkiwosno, Taptera kerowa; hash hawung neeki keer feeshanak sholsuwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zakkiwoos dey taptere kerere girak Yesusnin keeba ephphe hami. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Es baron biya asuni meya zuuttere: «Boor' sina asusa keer muu muunak giriwa» yit Yesusniista unyisete.<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Sinuntano Zakkiwoos yerere Yesusnin: «Daamiiso, fa otumnaasi isa kununon tukamiisik imanawa. Asuniistan eshak ephna waaga faafaanane acheech kushu zagira wolgunawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9-10"/>Yesus: «Asuni Naa tishi barin sholoknawa fu'oknatu yewa. Han asus dey Abrahamni naa sinna boor'a hash hawung faru han keyaasik siniwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 19:9-10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asir Wostinynyani Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Darani meya es baron odesefeen Yesus isa beso baassok make. Bar Yerusalem tai'sena boor'a asuni meyak Ha'oosi taato yaara kar'difanne faar sinna baassok beste. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Es bari boor'a ekka yi: «Taattere yoonak woka daa hama isa ulfinto asu feer. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Hamnoyfegedo zeemme wostinynyabaasasin asirin teegere: ‹Ta wolla yoonanneen nagadera bu'sutiwa› yit asir miinani imaat hami. <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Sinuntano es daasi asuni meya barin oomtesete boor'a: ‹Han asus innoosta taattonak aane sholefeni› yire hamnanneen orfo wosinin wossete.<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>«Sinuntano es asus taattere daabaasta wolle ye. Es wostinynyabaasik imna waagaason nagadesere awune faaron buu'sisetemato arunak teegsi. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Issoonsa wostinynyaas yeere: ‹Daamiiso, imta birriis asiron buu'ewa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Daambaas: ‹Ne ma'a wostinynya, ma'aron zagitwa. Garo wuzaasik amanamto sinna bestetwa. Asir katamaason ha'sutak ha'suni hugna neek imingwa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Hepsani wostinynyaas dey yeere: ‹Daamiiso imta birriis uuchon buu'ewa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Daambaas dey: ‹Ne uuch katamaason ha'sutak taassingwa› yi.<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>«Oom wostinynyaas dey yeere ekka yi: ‹Daamtaaso, erbesi birira kunsina birrinees hanifawa. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Ne kunsunoytaason ephtar; Buknoytaason dey kar'tar; Ne keena budu asu sinta boor'a digengwa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Daambaas dey ekka yi: ‹Ne mangu wostinynya, han wolumneesik neyista mangsu kar'anawa. Ta kunsunoynaason ephar, buknoynaason kar'a keena budu asu sinnaason aritannen; <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Ta yaara waagnaason koontobaasneen ephanak awagan baankini keer kunsu beyisso?› <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Estan Daamiis esta yeese baassok: ‹Waagaason barkin ephpha asir birri faana barik imtiwa› yi. <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Baasso wolgire: ‹Daamiiso, barki asir birriba faarwa› yisete. <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Daamiis ekka yi: ‹Nittok makefawungwa, faana barik daytera imterwa. Sinuntano foontoosatan barik fa barnu ootterwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Sinuntano ta baassosta taattonak sholonoy ta gumaasakitonin hani teshshera taaki sina worutiwa.› »<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Akama Ulfinak Yerusalem Giri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoha. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yesus es baron makenanneen orfo ek Yerusalem hamak nawoni meeni sina zeemi. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Dabrazayitini kumaasi tesha fa Betefagenewa Bitaniyane sinfa katama tai'senaase nawobaasasin heppin ekka yire wosi: <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>«Ek sinnitiista fa ke'eessi hamtiwa. Estak oonu barista duunoyna hanyani nawa tuptera yerefeen danati. Kotta yootiwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Oonu: ‹Awuniron kottifetirinso?› yisere mamussefaatene: ‹Daamiisik sholsu sinna boor'awa› » uti.<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Wostere hama baasso Yesus maktenaasimato danete. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Hanyaasi abani meya kotefeen biyere: «Awuniron kottifetirinso?» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Baasso dey wolgire: «Daamiisik sholsu sinna boor'awa» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Estan hanyaason Yesusniki ephphe yeesete. Geshobaasta maya kunussere Yesus duunak zagsete. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Asuni meya bar hamfena ugnaasta maybesiison yiir'et feeseter.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Dabrazayitini kumaastan kerefa ugnaasta tai'sesefe kabaasik basa nawoni meya biisete biistera artonoy wuza zuuttambaase asik girak tuumere kaambesiison teggire Ha'ooson ekka yit galattesete. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>«Daamiisa sunak yeefe taatoos suustowa. Den samak naga, ulfina dey tegira fa Ha'oosik sinun» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Daraasa ganesi fe isa isa Ferisawini meya Yesusnin: «Assinynyano, han nawoneesakito shaakkusonek zaguwa» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Bar dey: «Nittok makefawungwa, baasso shaakkisefeknu shu'aasikito chaagerwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Yerusalemki Katamaasik Waasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Yesus Yerusalem katamaassi tai'sere katamaason biyaat barik waasi. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>Ekka dey yi: «Neek naga sinni baron hawung aamse arita! Sinuntano hash ne aafaassin aachewe. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Ne gumaas biratoneeson ojba ojje ganeya gedde neen shana bessone wona yoonirwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Ha'oos neen fu'ok yaana baron aane aruwe sinna boor'a neennawa ne sikaloossi fa naanggotneesikitone asin worsone. Boktonoy isa shu'anu shu'aasta diira aafa bestona wuza.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Betemeqdesiissin Naggaddeesin Kalle Kisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat. 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoha. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Estan Yesus betemeqdesiissi girire estak nagadet fe baassotin kalle kisi. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Ekka dey yi: « ‹Ta keyaas Ha'o shiiphtona keyatu sinana› yisteratu tichche. Sinuntano nitto bo'inynyani meeni dugadug zagseti» yi.<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Yesus wonna wonna es betemeqdesiissi assit feer. Maagni gaanynye meenewa tumaasi assinynyana, daraasin ha'sife oom asuni meena barin woruk sholset feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Sinuntano daraas zuuttere barki tai'sere odet feeseter sinna boor'a isa wuzane zaguk aane chimoto.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Ha'suni Hugnaas Mamuste</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar. 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Isa wono Yesus betemeqdesiissi daraasin assifeennawa misirachchuni kaamaason makefeenna maagni gaanynye meenewa Museni tumaasi assinynyana dey kur'uni meena barki yeesere isa mamsu mamussete: <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>«Ne han baron zagifataas aro ha'suni hugnakinso? Wedey han baron zagutak ha'suni hugna neek imaas oonso makebbo?» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yesus dey wolgire ekka yi: «Ta dey isa mamsu nittotin mamsunawa. Nitto dey wolgutiwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Yohannis haphqifena bar den samaningwa wedey asunikininso?»<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Baassotna baassotna ekka yit merkesete: « ‹Den samanwa› iyaanine: ‹Eekin awuniron amano beytiso?› unir, <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>‹Asunikingwa› iyaanine daraas zuuttere Yohannis raajju sinbaason amaneseter sinna boor'a innotin shu'ak icheterwa» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Estan: «Ayin sinnamato aane aruweniwa» yire wolugsete. <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Ese ta dey han baron aro ha'suni hugnak zagifanamato nittok aafawa makona wuza» yi.<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wayinini Bulinynyaasa Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar. 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Tusire dey Yesus han besoson ekka yit daraasik make: «Isa asu wayinini akakilti tokke bulinynyani meyak kiraba kaassonek imaat showo neya ooma daa hamme woki. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Gaana zuuttona wona kar'fana kabaasik gaanaason ephak wostinynyabaasin bulinynyani meyaki wosi. Sinuntano bulinynyani meya wostinynyaasin ichesere kushkush gafuksete. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Hepsak dey oom wostinynyanin wosi. Barin dey ichesere iishshire kushkush gafuksete. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Keessak dey oom wostinynyanin wosi. Dey ichche mazasire gero kissere ha'sete. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Woyiniisi foshni aba: ‹Eekin awu zagunarinso? Dey isa keeshtefana naataasin wosuna. Awuzakne barin digere ulfinsusonetto› yi. <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Sinuntano bulinynyani meya naasi biyeteese baassotna baassotna: ‹Foshaas han bariktu kar'anawa, hani yaani woruniwa, estan foshaas innok sinanawa› yit merkesete. <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Naasin wayiniisi foshni gerakalo kisire worsete. Ese Wayiniisi akakiltiisi aba es bulinynyani meyaasta awu zagunir sinna bestefaso? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Wayiniisi akakiltiisi aba yeere es bulinynyani meyanon woruna; wayinini foshanon oomnik imana.» Asuni meya es baron odeseteyse: «Es bar ekka sinanaatawa!» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Sinuntano Yesus baassoki biyaat ekka yi: «Ese keyaason keer'fe baasso kashshire beyete i'oos keyaasik yeeto siniwa» yistera tichche bar aambanso? <verse eid="LUK 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Es yeetoosta heephtefe bar fulirwa. Basaasta gandena bar eester.<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Keesarnik Kaastoni Girboosi Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar. 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa maagni gaanynyana makte besos baassosta sinbaason arsefaat es kabaasik barin ephak sholsete. Sinuntano daraasi digsete. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Estan Yesusnin ephone kar'o sholset feeseter. Ha'sife basa kushuussinawa taatosi ha'suni hugnaaskina aatire imonek chinuni kaama noonobaassin kesfaan ephak oodet feeseter. Es bari boor'a ma'a asune feer sinne barkin chowa kephni aafonin wossete. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Aafoni meya Yesusniki yeesere ekka yire mamussete: «Assinynyano, ne futooson makefatamatonawa assifatamatona; Ha'oosi ugnanon dey isa koruba foontonon assifatamato arifeniwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Ese Romanni taate meeni taato Keesarnik girboni ima sholsungwa aanenso?»<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Sinuntano bar nibbesiisi mangu safaranon arifaat ekka yi: <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>«Isa duude taak besutiwa! Han barista fa gitoosewa tichaase oonirinso?» Baasso dey: «Keesarnirwa» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Yesus wolgire: «Ese Keesarnir sina baron Keesarnik imti. Ha'oosir sina baron Ha'oosik imti» yi. <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Es makena kaamaasik daraasa sinak barin ephak aane chimoto. Makena wolguusik diinqere shaakisete.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitun Kabuni Chowa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar. 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Kitun kabu aafawa yisefe isa isa Seduk'awini meya Yesusniki yeesere ekka yit mamussete: <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>«Assinynyano! ‹Isar asu ephphe nawa koonunoy kitifaanane aybaas asuson ephphe kiti barik zala sinni nawa koonuwo› yire Muse tichiwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Ese naafun ayna ayna feeseter. Arkiis asu ephphe nawa koonunoy kiti. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Hepsaas dey es asuson ephphe koonunoy kiti. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Keessaas dey es asuson ephi. Naafunobaase esiisimato es asuson ephere naanggota koonunoy kiti. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Koi'baasta dey asus kiti. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Ese naafunobesiise asuson ephete. Kitun kabuni wono ooni asunso sinanari?»<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesus baassok wolgire: «Han daasi naanggota asu epheter dey girseter. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Yooni daasta fook kitun kabsoni baasso aafa asu ephone wuza wedey girusone wuza. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Ha'oni wosiyane feer sinone sinna boor'a aafa kitusone wuza. Kitun kabsete boor'a baasso Ha'oni naanggotawa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Kitun kabuni chowaasik Muse saabaassi kiichchoni tochoossi Daamiisin: ‹Abrahamni Ha'o, Yisaqni Ha'o, Yaqobni Ha'o› yire teegewa. <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Zuuttambesiise barik hayew sinete boor'a bar hayewni meeni Ha'otano kituni meeni Ha'otawa.»<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Museni tumaasi assinynyani meyaassin isa isaas: «Assinynyano, ne ma'arontu maketwa» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Esseen orfo isa asunu Yesusnin mamsuk aane chimoto.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoos Ooni Naambe?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar. 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Estan Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Asuni meya Kiristoosni aakkakinso: ‹Dawitni naawa› yisefeysi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42-43"/>Dawit teetbaasik gaamni tichaassi ekka yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42-43">« ‹Daamiis Daamtaasik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">gumaneesin wochoneesi sikalosi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">yer'atak zagunanneen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42-43">ta hoi'taasta duwa› yiwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:42-43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>«Ese Dawit Daam yire teegenanneen aakkak Kiristoos nawuba sinnirinso?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Asuni meya zuuttere odesefeen Yesus nawobaasakitonik ekka yi: <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>«Dicha maama mayere kutisefaat gabaasta asuni meya baassotin naga ooshshosonek sholset Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi dey ulfinni kodta duuk, koota maastefanaasta ulfinni dima sholsefe Museni tumaason assinynyani meyakin teetnitiison oodtiwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Baasso dicha asusi keyanon meere turuksuk asu taan biyowa iyaat shiiphobesiison dichisefe. Es baasso akama mangsuni kar'atu ephphetoosonewa.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Isa Dicha Asuni Ima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar. 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yesus otumni meya waaga kephtefana saxiniissi waagbesiison ha'sefeen bi. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Esiisimato isa tukama dicha asu hep duude imdifeen biyaat: <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>«Futo nittok makefawungwa, han tukama dicha asus zuuttambesiise asi denalo imiwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Asuni meya fa waagbesiistan fu'tesontu imete. Sinuntano han asus barik fayiison koi'siratu imi» yi.<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Betemeqdesiis Boktonir Sinbaason Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar. 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Isa isa asuni meya betemeqdesiis keeshu keeshu shu'aknawa Ha'oosik imte waaga asikna keeshira keetobaason wolumset feeseter. Sinuntano Yesus ekka yi: <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>«Han biifeti bar zuuttambaase shu'aas shu'aasta kopuktera keetenamato boktona wona yoona.» <verse eid="LUK 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Baasso dey: «Assinynyano! Han bar aagenso sinanari? Bar dey sinanak besoba aambanso?» yire mamussete.<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shananewa Kaltere Kofuktone Yoona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat. 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar. 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesus ekka yire wolgi: «Daagonoytimato arutiwa. Showo asuni meya: ‹Ta Kiristooswa, wonaas ta'i› yit ta sunaasik yoosone. Sinuntano nitto baassok zoonustotiita. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Neeboosi odunonnawa daraasa mangu wolumni shorkone asin odefeti kabaasik nawotiita. Es bar zeemma sinanak sholsuwa. Sinuntano koi'baas geregere aafa sinanawuza.» <verse eid="LUK 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Tusire Yesus ekka yi: «Dara daraasata, taato taatoosta kabuna. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Akama daani shorko sinana. Daadaassi dey maknewa, showo tesa merone sinana. Den saman akama deessu beso sinana. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Sinuntano es bar zuuttambaase sinbaasneen zeemma asuni meya nittotin ephone dey kabugsone. Ayhudni shiipho keernawa taatoni keerna aatire imone. Ta sunaasi boor'a taatoni meyakinawa daason ha'sife baassokina taamone. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Es bar dey ta sunaasik zaala makotik ma'a ugna sinana. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Ese mamustoti mamsusik ‹Awu wolgunirinso?› yira zeemma safaronoytimato nibnitiissi ephtiwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Nitto gumaas wolguknawa merokna chimnoyna kaamnewa arune ta nittok imanawa. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Nittotin kooni baassonawa aynitiisakitona, koonnitiisnawa zomontiisna nittotin aatire imone. Nittoossin isa isaas wortosone. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Ta sunaasi boor'a asu zuuttambaase nittotin oomtona. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Sinuntano somnitiisi ganesin isarnu aafa tishuna wuza. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Chimme yerok kaantiison fu'otiwa.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Yerusalem Tishunamato Zeemme Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat. 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mar. 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Meya taar'oos gumaas Yerusalemnon biratere kuphobaason biifeti kabaasik bar tishunak ta'baason arutiwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Es kabaasik Yuudaki daasta feese baasso den aamaaski eeloto. Katamaassi fe baasso kesoto. Gerakalo feese baasso katamaassi girsoneeta. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Tichchera fa raajiis zuuttambaase ko'unak haniis gumani kaastoni wonawa. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Es kabaasik naaner asusikitonewa nawa tanifa barikitone haybubawungwa! Daasta akama shana sinana. Daraasata dey Ha'oni gi'a yoona. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Baassossin showobesiis siifok kacchere kitusone. Boojchesere dey daadaassi hamone. Es Aazabni meeni neyaas ko'unanneen Yerusalem Aazabni yetona.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asuni Naani Hepsa Wolle Yoo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat. 24:29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Awaasta, assaastanawa baakuraastana diinqi beso sinana. Baariisewa akaasi guubone asi deessu kaamaasikna daa zuuttambaase asiista fe daraasin tiir'o ephana. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Samaastaki testoni shorkotan kabi chowa asuni meya han daasta yooni wuzason oodak digak shorkosone. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Es kabaasik Asuni Naa akama hugnaknawa akama ulfinakna shaaruusta yeefeen biyone. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Nitto dey es wuzaasikito sinanak tesifana kabaasik fui'tontiis tai'sena boor'a den kaanna biiti.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daamiisa Yoonon Besifa Belesini I'oosi Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:2-35">Mat. 24:2-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar. 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yit han besoson make: «Belesini i'oosewa ooma i'oosikitononna biitiwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Tosha kotin biifeti kabaasik bega tai'senamato aruti. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Esiisimato es wuzaasikito sinin biifeti kabaasik Ha'oosi taato ta'baason aruti. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa, es bar zuuttambaase ko'unanneen han koontoos aafa aatana wuza. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Samaasewa daase aatana. Sinuntano kaamnaas aafa aatana wuza.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chimme Ooda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Nibnitiis ushak, zayyak, han daastaki fooson safarok hopunoynamato arutiwa. Es baron shakaatine es wonaas dey diinqo eshminimatotu nittotin ephanawa. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Es wonaas han daasta fe asu zuuttambaase asin ephana. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Es bari boor'a yooni mangu wuzaassin aatatiknawa Asuni Naani sina dey yerok chimatikna wonna wonna chimma shiiphotiwa.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Yesus wonna wonna betemeqdesiissi assifaafe waali waalin Dabrazayitini kumaasta kesse ha'it feer. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Asuni meya dey barkin odok e'so e'so betemeqdesiissi hamet feeseter.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Maagni Gaannye Meya Yesusnin Ephphe Woruk Sholsete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoha. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Ayhudni faasika yistefa kixxani heeboos zagtona wona ta'a faar. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Maagni gaanynye meenewa Museni tumaasi assinynyana daraasin digsefaat Yesusnin aakkak worsonemato ugna sholset feeseter.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuuda Yesusnin Aatire Imak Merke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat. 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar. 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Sexana asire heppe nawobaasa ganesin isa Askorotki Yuuda sinfe basaassi giri. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Estan Yuuda Maagni gaanynye meyakinawa betemeqdesiisi tasoni meeni ha'sinynyani meyakina hamme Yesusnin aakkak aatire imanamato merke. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Baasso dey chowbaasik girere birri barik imonek wuli girsete. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Es wuliisik ma'i yire aatire imanak asu foonto kar'o oodet feer.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Ayhudni Faasikani Meeta'uson Wosini Meyaneen Me</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat. 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoha. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Esseen orfo Ayhudni faasikani fantu shuktona kixxani heeboos kar'i. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesus: «Faasikani meeta'uson muunik hamma hoossutiwa» yire Phexiros Yohannisna asin wosi. <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Baasso dey wolgire: «Ayhudni faasikani meeta'uson ay hoossunikinso sholefa tari?» yit mamussete. <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Bar dey: «Ek katamaassi girifeti kabaasik akani gima wor'o asuni danati. Orfobaase hamfaat bar girina keyaassi giruti. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Estan keeni abaasin: ‹Assinynyaas nawobaasneen ane Ayhudni faasikani meeta'uson muuna irbani keya ayfaso?› yifewa uti. <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Asus irbanik hoorera di keeni tukta keete keya besuna. Nitto dey esta hoossuti.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Es hep nawobaas dey hamere zuuttambaase Yesus makenaasimato sinin danere meeta'uson esta hoossisete.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daamiisa Meeta'uni Tuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat. 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar. 14:22-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Meeta'uni sa'atiis kar'fana kabaasik Yesus wosibaasakitoneen muunak kasayere di. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Tayista kar'ni shanaason ephphatoonaasneen zeemma han meeta'uson nittoneen muunak akamanon sholettu fawungwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Nittok makefawungwa, Ha'oosi taatosi han bari aacho chowaas ko'unanneen han faasikani meeta'uson hepsi aafa muuna wuza.»<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Estan ushaason toofobaase ephphe Ha'o galattefaat: «Esewa, zuuttamnitiise han baron haa'era ushtiwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Nittok makefawungwa, hashneen kabira Ha'oosi taato yoonanneen han wayiniisi ushanon aafawa ushanawuza.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Tushaason dey ephphe Ha'o galattefaat batte imet: «Esewa, han bar nittok imtoni ashnaaswa. Han baron taan safaronir zagutiwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Meeta'uneen orfo dey ushaason toofobaase ephphe: «Han ushati bar ta nittok wuukuna arinnaasne faarwa. Bar dey nittotin Ha'oneen ane gansuni gaddo teyyawa.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>«Sinuntano taan aatire imni asusa kushu han maddiista taneentu fawa. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Asuni Naa zeemma Ha'oosi kaamsi maktera kunnaasimato kitunir. Sinuntano barin kituk aatire imni bar haybubawowa!»<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Nawobaasakito dey: «Inno ganeyaassi han effatena wuzason zaguniis oonso?» yiset baassotna baassotna mamussesete.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zuuttambaase Asiistan Arkir Oombe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Tusire nawobaasakito dey: «Inno ganeyaassin arkir oonso?» yit baassotna baassotna we'nisete. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Han daasi taatoni meya darabesiisata ha'suni hugnabesi faarwa. Ha'sife baasso dey ma'aron zagir yisteretu teegtesefewa. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Sinuntano nitto ekka zagutiitawa. Nittoossin arkiis hater, dey ha'sife bar wostinynyane feer sinowa. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Muuk muunak tai'sere fe barnawa yerefaat woshfe barna asiissin oonso arkiri? Muu muunak tai'sere fe bartenoso? Sinuntano ta nitto ganeyaassi isa wostinynyane faanarwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Nitto taan shana ephfana kabaasik chimma taneen yeretiwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Abataas taan taassinaasimato ta dey nittotin taassunawa. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Taatonaassi ta maddiistan muuti dey ushati. Kinawoosta diifaat asire heppe Israelni zalaasta mangsu kar'atiwa.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Yesusni Kaadonamato Keemme Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoha. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Simonno! Simonno! Sexana nittotin zago si'anne si'anak mamsiwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Sinuntano amantonees tishunoynamato neekwa iyaat Ha'o shiiphen. Ne taaki wolifa ta kabaasik ayneesakitoni chinuwa.»<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Simon wolgire: «Daamiiso, ta taatoni keer giruk, kituk neneen ane hooreratu fawungwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «phexiros Hash hawung ako oorunoyfeen keeza wolla taan mormotawa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Estan Yesus nawobaasakitonin: «Waagni kar'diddi, ha'mato, chaa'ma ephnoytiron nittotin wosina kabaasik yo'i wuza faaroso?» yi. Baasso dey: «Isanne yo'i wuza aafawa» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Ese hash waagni kar'diddinewa ha'matone faana bar ephowa. Siifoba foontoos maybaason kisire waagere siifo waagowo. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Nittok makefawungwa, ta chowaasik zeemma tichaassi: ‹Manguni meyaneen faadtewa› yiste bar ko'unak sholsuwa.»<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Nawobaasakito dey: «Daamiiso, hantak hep siifo faarwa» yisete. Bar dey: «Hooronawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Zayitini I'o Diina Kumaasta Shiiphe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar. 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yesus ooma wonoti zagifenaasimato Dabrazayitini kumaasta hami. Nawobaasakito dey ane hamete. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Esta kar'efe kabaasik: «Fatanasi girunoytimato Ha'o shiiphotiwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Baassostan shu'a ha'tera kar'fanaasne fa dima wokke hamme kaa'nere ekka yit shiiphe: <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>«Abataaso! Shunfaatane han ta ephphatoonak fa shanani toofooson tayistan shaalwa. Es bar dey ne shuntasimato sinuntano ta shunnaasimatota.» <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Estan Ha'oosi wosiya dey saman yaara barin chini. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Es kabaasik akamanon tiir'o barin ephaan shiiphet feer. Chawobaas dey harinnimato daasta tokit faar. <verse eid="LUK 22:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Shiiphotan kabire nawobaaski wolle ye. Baasso dey suumotan kabi chowa kunefeen danne ekka yi: <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>«Awagan kuntirinso? Fatanasi girunoytimato kabira shiiphotiwa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Gumabaasa Kushusi Ootte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoha. 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Yesus es baro makefeen asire heppe nawobaasasin isa Yuuda sinfe bar showo asuni zoonsire yeere kar'i. Yuuda dey Yesusnin daamok tai'se. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Yuudano! Asuni Naani daamoknoso aatira imatari?» yi.<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Yesusneen ane fe nawoni meya es chowaason biyaat: «Daamiiso! Siifok kaconiroso?» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Baassossin isaas maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyani wostinynyaasa hoi'ta odonon kace.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Beywa! Hepsa effatena wuza zagutaatawa» iyaat asusa odonon ta'ire fati.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Estan Yesus barin ephak yeese maagni gaanynye meyanon, betemeqdesiisi tasoni meyanon ha'sife baassonawa kur'uni meyanonna ekka yi: «Bo'inynyani ephni asunimato siifonewa mukne ephpha yaasetiyoso? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Wonna wonna betemeqdesiissi nittoneen ane faana kabaasik aane ephoweti. Haye han bar nittotnawa talmaasi ha'sune asi wonawa.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Yesusni Kaade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat. 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar. 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoha. 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Estan Yesusnin epha asuni meya Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasa ojni keerkalo taamete. Phexiros dey woksok barneen ane hamdifer. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Asuni meya Maagiisa ojni keerkalo geya sookere isarik diifaat besisedifer. Phexiros dey baasso ganeyaassi geeni besuk di. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Isa keeri wostinynya Phexiros geeni diya diifen gasasira biyaat: «Han asus Yesusneen ane feerwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Sinuntano Phexiros: «Ne han asuse! Makefata barin aane arifatwe» yi. <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Garono feere isa asu dey biire: «Ne baassossin isaaswa» yi. Phexiros: «Ne han asuso! Tatewa!» yi.<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Garo wonaneen orfo oom asu dey Phexirosni biyaat: «Futok han asu Galiilakir sinna boor'a barneen ane feerwa.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Sinuntano Phexiros: «Ne han asuso! Makefata baron ta aane arifatwa.» Es baron makere koi'sunoyfeen geregere ako oori. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Es kabaasik Yesus yerqere Phexirosnin bi. Phexiros: «Hash hawung ako oorunoyfeen keeza wolla taan mormotawa» yire Daamiis makena kaamaason yaadate. <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Ek gerakalo kesse akamanon suumere waasi.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Es kabaasik Yesusnin ephaat fe asuni meya barin kanyere icheset feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Aaffaason ukaat: «Oonso neen ichari? Raajju sinfaatane aribbo?» yit feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Showo wuza maket me'et feeseter.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusniista Mangsu Kate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoha. 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Wonfana kabaasik daraasa kur'uni meya, Maagni gaanynye meenawa Museni tumaasi assinynyana zuuttesete. Estan Yesusnin es baasso kuphamaasta tai'sisete. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Ekka dey yisete: «Ne Kiristoosnoso? Innok makebbo.» Yesus wolgire ekka yi: «Makefanak aane amanefeti. <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Mamsifanak aane wolgifeti. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Sinuntano hawungneen kabira Asuni Naa Ha'oosi hugnani hoi'ta ulfinto dimaasta duunirwa.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Es kabaasik zuuttesere: «Eekin ne Ha'oni naanoso?» yisete. Bar dey: «Aa, sinnaason nittonu maksetiwa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Baasso dey: «Hanneen ekalo oom zaal aane sholsifewa. Innonu basa noonoossin odeniwa» yisete.<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Pilatoosni Sina Ta'i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoha. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Esta fe asuni meya zuuttesere kabi Yesusnin ephere Pilatosniki taamete. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Ekka yit barin malatesete: «Han asus daraniisin eshfeen, keesarnik girbo giribtonoynamato kalfeen dey: ‹Ta Kiristoos taatowa› yifeen danni.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilatos: «Ne Ayhudni taatonoso?» yire mamsi. Yesus dey: «Ne yitaasimatowa» yire wolgi. <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Estan Pilatos maagni gaanynyaniknawa daraasikna ekka yi: «Ta han asusatan isa mangsune aane danutwa.»<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Sinuntano baasso: «Han asus Galiilan kabira hanta kar'ananneen, Yuudaki daa zuuttambaase asiissi daraasin manguk kabgit feerwa» yiset chinire malatesete.<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Herodisni Sina Ta'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Pilatos Galiilan yiste baron odenaase: «Han bar Galiilaki asunoso?» yit mamsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Yesus Herodisni ha'suussin yeer sinbaason Pilatos araat Herodisniki wosi. Es kabaasik Herodis Yerusalem yeere feer. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Herodis Yesusnin biyanak showo wona sholet feer sinna boor'a biinaase akamanon gire. Yesus zagit feefena biistera artonoy wuzason wosten biyanak sholet feer. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Es bari boor'a Yesusnin showo mamsu mamsi. Sinuntano Yesus isanne aane wolguwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Maagni gaanynye meenawa Museni tumaasi assinynyana chinire malatet feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Herodis meya taar'obaasneen ane Yesusni kashshire kanynye keeshu maama maysire wolgire Pilatosniki gafki. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Herodisnawa Pilatosna zeemme faassere feyiis es wono ganere zomo sinete.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusniista Kituni Mangsu Kate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat. 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Yoha. 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Estan Pilatos maagni gaanynyanin, daraasin ha'sife baassotnawa daraasinna isarik zuutire teege. <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>Ekka dey yi: « ‹Han asu daraasin mangu ugnak zoonsiwa› yira taaki teshsheti. Ta nitto sinak tu'nira nitto maketi malataassin isa mangsu basaastan aane danut. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Esiisimato Herodis dey isa mangsu aane dane sinna boor'a innoki wolgire gafki. Ese han asusin kituta katuni mangsu aane zaguwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Es bari boor'a baak ichcha kotanawa.»<verse eid="LUK 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>[Pilatos heebo heeboosi wonak isa taatonin baassok kotar.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Estan dara zuuttere isarik: «Han asusin tishkaat Barbaannin innok kotwa» yit chaagete. <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Barbaan katamaassi fe daraasin manguk kabgubaasiknawa kaa worubaasikna taatere fe asu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilatos Yesusnin kotanak sholefaat hepsa daraasin mamsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Sinuntano daraas: «Suutwa! Suutwa!» yit chaagete.<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilatos keezsa wolgire: «Han asu wostena mangsu aambanso? Ta barin kituta katuni mangsu aane danut sinna boor'a ichcha kotanawa?» yi.<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Sinuntano baasso kaambesiison teggire: «Suutwa» yisete. Baasso chaagaas dey aatami. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Es bari boor'a Pilatos sholseteeson zagsonek baassok aatire imi. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Daraasi manguk kabgirenawa kaa worirena taatere fe Barbaannin kotanak mamussete. Es asusin dey baassok kotaat Yesusnin sholseteeson zagsonek aatire imi.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Suutte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoha. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Yesusnin ephphe hamefeen Kerenaki asu Simon yiste ugunni wof balagarin katama yeefeen danere mesqeliison wossire basa orfoose hamanak zagsete. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Showo dara dey Yesusni orfoose hamedifer. Es baassossin nibbesiison ki'et, waasset fa mashkasu faaser. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Sinuntano Yesus baassoki yerqere ekka yi: «Nitto Yerusalemki mashkasuse, nitto teetasiknawa naanggotnitiisikna waasutitano taak waasutiita. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Ese: ‹Zagiyaas, koonunoy magaasewa tanunoy tamaase suusto› ustona wona yoona. <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Es kabaasik asuni meya aamaason: ‹Innoosta gandowe› Kumaason dey: ‹Innotin aachuwe› uuk kabosone <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Ese han baron kewa i'oosta ekka zagtenanneen ichmaasta awu zagsonkoso?» <verse eid="LUK 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Esiisimato mangu wosto woste hep asunin dey Yesusneen ane woruk ephphe hamete. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Keraniyo yiste dimaasta kar'eteese Yesusnin esta suutete. Dey mangu wosto woste asusakitonin isaasin hoi'taasta, hepsaasin aldaasta suutete. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Esseen orfo Yesus: «Abataaso, zagsefe baron aane arsoto sinna boor'a feeshun uwa» yi. Meya taar'oni meya dey maybaasta ixa ha'sere haa'esete. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Es kabaasik daraas yerefa biidifer. Daraasin ha'sife baasso: «Oomiisin fu'e, Ha'o barin korina Kiristoos sinfaanane teetbaason fu'en biyaniwa» yit kanyesete.<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Meya taar'osakito dey esiisimato kanyesete. Barki tai'sere suqaro wayinini usha imet: <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Esiisimato dey: «Ne Ayhudni taato sinfaatane teetneeson fu'owa» yiset feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Suuttena mesqeliisi teetta: «Haniis Ayhudni taatowa» yifa ticha tichire yeetisete.<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hep Boor' Asu Yesusneen Ane Suutte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:38-44">Mat. 27:38-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:27-32">Mar. 15:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Mangu wosto wostere suutte baassossin isaas Yesusnin: «Ne Kiristoostenoso? Ese teetneesonnawa innotinna fu'owa» yit me'i.<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Sinuntano hepsaas wolgire ekka yit ke'i: «Neyista kituni mangsu katera feen Ha'ooson aane digefenoso? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Inno zagini mangsuusik sholsu ke'o ephpha taadifenir. Sinuntano han asus isa mangsu aane mangsuwewa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Tusire Yesusnin: «Daamiiso! Taato sinna yaafata kabaasik taan safarowa» yi. <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesus wolgire: «Neek futo makefawungwa, hash hawung taneen ane genneti footawa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoha. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Es kabaasik wonaasi issun sa'atin kabira izgin kar'ananneen daas zuuttera talme. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Awaas talme; betemeqdesiisi yinu heppik karate. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yesus akama tega kaamak chaagge: «Abataaso! Kaanaason ne kushuussi adarak imingwa» yi. Es kabaasik geregere kaabaas kesi. <verse eid="LUK 23:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Tii meya taar'oni gaanynyaas sina chowaason biinaase: «Han asus futok ookowa» yit Ha'ooson galatte.<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Es baron biyak esta zuuttere fe asus sina chowaason zuutire biyeteese nibbesiison ki'et wolsete. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Yesusnin tai'sonon arsefe baassonawa Galiilan kabsere basa orfoose hama mashkasuse zuuttere woksok yersefaat sinfa wuzason biyet feeseter.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Moogsi Giri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoha. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Ayhudni shongo zuuttesefe baassossin isa Yosef yiste ma'a ooko asu feer. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Es asus Yesusniista zagte kituni mangsuni kar'ni chowaassi aane giruwe. Bar dey Armatiyas yistefa Yuudani katamaassi Ha'oosi taatoni yoonon abdik oodet feer. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Pilatosniki hamme Yesusni dugnooson imanak shiiphe. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Estan dugnooson kessire maama kimme shu'ak katera hoore oonu kabbartonoyna moogsi kabbare. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Es baron zaginaas beysani wonni hooroni wonaasik.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Galiilan kabsera Yesusni orfoose ya mashkasusikito Yosefneen hamera moogaason biye. Dugnobaas dey aakka kabbartenamato biyete. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Estan keebesi wolsere dugnooson woshshuk kimaminewa shittone hoossisete. Tumaasimato beysani wonaasik beysa ephete.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kitun Kabi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat. 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoha. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Guddani wono wonsa waassiise mashka meya hoossisete shittooson ephere ek moogaaski hamete. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Moogaasta uktera kuni shu'aas bukalera kunfeen danete. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Sinuntano moogaassi mogire biyeten Yesusni dugnooson aane danoto. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Han bar aambanso iyaat diinqesefeen akamanon palpalu chaaret yere maya mayo hep asu baasso tesha yere. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Mashka meya digsefaat daassi biyefeen asusakito baassok ekka yi: «Hayew sina barin awuniron kituni meeni ganeyaassin sholedifetirin? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Bar kabi! Hantak aafe. Galiilaki feena kabaasik awu makenamato yaadatoti. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‹Asuni Naa boor'ni meeni kushuussi aattere imtonak, suuttonaknawa keessinari wono kitun kabunakna sholsu› yire makenar faar.»<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Mashka meya dey Yesus makena kaamaason yaadatesete. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Moogaasi estan wolsere biyete baron zuutire asire isse nawobaasiknawa oom meyakna maksete. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Es baron wosini meyak maksees megdelawitki Maarami, Yohannanewa Yaqobna asi into Maarami, dey ooma mashka meya feeseter. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Sinuntano baasso mashka meya maksete bar miitone faar sinna bestena boor'a aane amantosoto. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Sinuntano Phexiros kabi moogaaski eeli. Esta kar'faat sir mogire biin sesa kinoni maamaas bar bar kunfeen biyaat diinqet wolle keer ye.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Hep Nawoni Meyak Uphe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar. 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Es wono nawoni meyaassin hep asu kabire Yerusalemun asire heppe kiilo meetiri wokba faana Hemawos yiste ke'esi hamedifer. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Baasso dey sina chowaason zuuttambaase kabgire wolumsedifer. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Es chowaason safaretnawa wolletna feeseten Yesus tai'sere baassoneen hamdifer. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Sinuntano aafbesiisik biyefet bar oo sinnamato aane arsoto. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yesus dey: «Ugunne hamfaat nittotna nittotna wollefeti wuzaas aambanso?» yi. Baasso dey suumere shaakkire yessete. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Baassossin isa Keleyopha yistefe asus ekka yi: «Hangnettaki wonaassi han Yerusalemuk sina chowaason arunoy asu nenenetu irbawa.»<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Bar dey: «Sina chowaas aambanso?» yi. Baasso dey ekka yisete: «Naaziretki Yesusniista zagte barwa. Bar Ha'onewa asu zuuttambaase asi sinana wostoknawa kaamakna chim raajjuwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Barin maagni gaanynyanawa innotin ha'sife baassotna kituni mangsu kar'e aatire imere suutete. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Sinuntano inno Israelnon furonirwa yira abdi zaginiis baringwa. Es bar sinnanneen hawung keez wonawa. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22-23"/>Inno ganeyaassin isa isa mashka meya innotin diinqisisetewa. Baasso wonsa waasi ek moogaaski hamere dugnobaason turuksete. Wolsere bar hayew sinbaason make Ha'oni wosini kaama odesenamato innok maksete. <verse eid="LUK 24:22-23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Inno ganeyaassin isa isa meya ek moogaaski hamme es mashka meya makseteesimato sinin biyete. Sinuntano Yesusnin aane biyoto.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Yesus dey baassok: «Nitto yaadatonoornawa raajjuni meya maksete baron amanok nibnitiis taptonor. <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Kiristoos han shanaason ephphetoonaknawa den ulfinbaaski girunak aane sholsifano?» yi. <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Estan Museni tumaassinnawa raajjuni meeni tichaassinna kabgire barik tichche baron korto ticha zuuttambaase asiissin kisaafe assi.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Baasso hamefe ke'eessi tai'sesefe kabaasik Yesus aatte hamninne feer sinne baassok beste. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Sinuntano baasso: «Gerok waali, awaas dey giridifar sinna boor'a innoneen ha'uwa» yit chinire shiiphsete. Bar dey baassoneen ha'uk keer giri. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Baassoneen ane muuk di. Tushaason dey ephphe galattefaat batte imi. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Es kabaasik aaffesiis gachchen Yesus sinbaason arsete. Sinuntano bar baasso sinan tishi. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Baassotna baassotna dey: «Ugnaasta faani innotin wolumsit kayma tichaassin kisaafe maken nibniison geenimato matanoso?» yisesete.<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Es kabaasik kabsere Yerusalem wolle hamete. Estak asire isse nawobaasnawa baassoneen feese baassotna asin isarik zuuttere feeseten danete. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Baasso dey: «Daamiis futok kabiwa! Simoonniknu bestewa» yisete. <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Es hep nawoni meya ugnaasta sina barewa Yesus tushaason batfena kabaasik aakkak arsetematona maksete.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Nawobaasakitonik Beste</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoha. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Wos. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Es baron wolumsefeen Yesus bar ganebesiissi yerefaat: «Naga nittok sinfawung!» yi.<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Sinuntano baasso nayere kita biyetenne faar sinfaan digak tuumete. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Yesus dey ekka yi: «Awuniron nayedifetirinso? Awagan nibnitiissi mamefaso? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Kushunaasewa wochonaase asin biiti. Taptira ta sinnaason aruti. Taan biifetiisimato kitaas ashnewa megane barki aafawa.»<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Es baron makefaat kushubaasewa wochobaase asin baassok besi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Baasso dey giraknawa diinqokna tuumefaat bar sinbaason aane amanosoto. Yesus dey ekka yi: «Isa maastoni wuza faaroso?» yire mamsi. <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Baasso dey kiichcho kurxummi imete. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Bar dey ephphe baasso sinak me.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Yesus ekka dey yi: «Nittoneen ane faana kabaasik Museni tumaassi raajjuni meeni tichaassinawa gaamni tichaassina taak tichche bar zuuttera ko'unak sholsu yira nittok makenaas haniiswa» yi.<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Es kabaasik korto tichaason yaadatsonek nibbesiison gachi. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Ekka dey yi: «Kiristoos shana ephphetoonamatonawa keezsinari wono dey kitun kabunamatona zeemma tichchera faar. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Esiisimato dey Yerusalemun kabira dara zuuttambaase asik harminewa boor'ni fakine basa sunaasik awastonir yistera tichche. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Es barik nitto zaalwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Ta abataas nittok imna abdiison nittok wosuna. Nitto dey denun hugna imtona kabaneen Yerusalem katamaassi footi.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Den Sama Hami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar. 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Wos. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Esseen orfo nawobaasakitonin ephphe Bitaniya hami. Kushubaason kabgire baassotin suusi. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Suusfet baassostan oor kesse den sama hami. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Baasso dey barik kaa'nere akama girak Yerusalem wolle hamete. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Ha'ooson galattet wonna wonna betemeqdesiissi aane tishisefe.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
